   2662 Schedule:Day:Interval,
   2663        \extensible:2 - repeat last two fields, remembering to remove ; from "inner" fields.
   2664        \memo A Schedule:Day:Interval contains a full day of values with specified end times for each value
   2665        \memo Currently, is set up to allow for 10 minute intervals for an entire day.
   2666        \min-fields 5
   2667   A1 , \field Name
   2668        \required-field
   2669        \type alpha
   2670        \reference DayScheduleNames
   2671   A2 , \field Schedule Type Limits Name
   2672        \type object-list
   2673        \object-list ScheduleTypeLimitsNames
   2674   A3 , \field Interpolate to Timestep
   2675        \note when the interval does not match the user specified timestep a Average choice will average between the intervals request (to
   2676        \note timestep resolution. A No choice will use the interval value at the simulation timestep without regard to if it matches
   2677        \note the boundary or not. A Linear choice will interpolate linearly between successive values.
   2678        \type choice
   2679        \key Average
   2680        \key Linear
   2681        \key No
   2682        \default No
