   3261 Schedule:Day:List,
   3262       \memo Schedule:Day:List will allow the user to list 24 hours worth of values, which can be sub-hourly in nature.
   3263       \min-fields 5
   3264       \extensible:1
   3265   A1 , \field Name
   3266        \required-field
