   3272   A3 , \field Interpolate to Timestep
   3273        \note when the interval does not match the user specified timestep a "Average" choice will average between the intervals request (to
   3274        \note timestep resolution.  A "No" choice will use the interval value at the simulation timestep without regard to if it matches
   3275        \note the boundary or not. A "Linear" choice will interpolate linearly between successive values.
   3276        \type choice
   3277        \key Average
   3278        \key Linear
   3279        \key No
   3280        \default No
   3281   N1 , \field Minutes per Item
   3282        \note Must be evenly divisible into 60
   3283        \type integer
   3284        \minimum 1
   3285        \maximum 60
