   4093 Schedule:Compact,
   4094    \extensible:1 - repeat last field, remembering to remove ; from "inner" fields.
   4095    \min-fields 5
   4096    \memo Irregular object.  Does not follow the usual definition for fields.  Fields A3... are:
   4097    \memo Through: Date
   4098    \memo For: Applicable days (ref: Schedule:Week:Compact)
   4099    \memo Interpolate: Average/Linear/No (ref: Schedule:Day:Interval) -- optional, if not used will be "No"
   4100    \memo Until: <Time> (ref: Schedule:Day:Interval)
   4101    \memo <numeric value>
   4102    \memo words "Through","For","Interpolate","Until" must be included.
   4103    \format compactSchedule
