   6413        \maximum< 1
   6414        \minimum> 0
   6415        \default 0.91
   6416   N11; \field Back Side Shade Material Infrared Emissivity
   6417        \note The back side long-wave emissivity of the shade material at zero shade
   6418        \note openness. Openness fraction is used to calculate the effective emissivity
   6419        \note value.
   6420        \type real
   6421        \units dimensionless
   6422        \maximum< 1
   6423        \minimum> 0
   6424        \default 0.91
