   6473        \note The back side beam-diffuse solar reflectance at normal incidence averaged
   6474        \note over the entire spectrum of solar radiation.
   6475        \type real
   6476        \units dimensionless
   6477        \minimum 0
   6478        \maximum< 1
   6479   N6 , \field Drape Beam-Beam Visible Transmittance
   6480        \note The beam-beam visible transmittance at normal incidence averaged over the
   6481        \note visible spectrum of solar radiation. Assumed same for front and back sides.
   6482        \type real
   6483        \units dimensionless
   6484        \minimum 0
   6485        \maximum< 1
   6486   N7 , \field Drape Beam-Diffuse Visible Transmittance
   6487        \note The beam-diffuse visible transmittance at normal incidence averaged over the
   6488        \note visible spectrum range of solar radiation. Assumed to be the same for front
   6489        \note and back sides.
   6490        \type real
   6491        \units dimensionless
   6492        \minimum 0
   6493        \maximum< 1
