   6495        \note The beam-diffuse visible reflectance at normal incidence average over the
   6496        \note visible spectrum range of solar radiation. Assumed to be the same for front
   6497        \note and back sides.
   6498        \type real
   6499        \units dimensionless
   6500        \minimum 0
   6501        \maximum< 1
   6502   N9 , \field Drape Material Infrared Transmittance
   6503        \note Long-wave transmittance of the drape fabric at zero openness fraction.
