   6522        \note emissivity value.
   6523        \type real
   6524        \units dimensionless
   6525        \maximum< 1
   6526        \minimum> 0
   6527        \default 0.87
   6528   N12, \field Width of Pleated Fabric
   6529        \note Width of the pleated section of the draped fabric. If the drape fabric is
