   6676        \note The back side beam-diffuse solar reflectance of the slat
   6677        \note averaged over the entire solar spectrum of solar radiation.
   6678        \required-field
   6679        \type real
   6680        \units dimensionless
   6681        \maximum< 1
   6682        \minimum 0
