   6831 WindowMaterial:Glazing:EquivalentLayer,
   6832        \min-fields 11
   6833        \memo Glass material properties for Windows or Glass Doors
   6834        \memo Transmittance/Reflectance input method.
   6835   A1 , \field Name
   6836        \required-field
   6837        \type alpha
   6838        \reference WindowEquivalentLayerMaterialNames
