  15290 Shading:Zone:Detailed,
  15291   \extensible:3 -- duplicate last set of x,y,z coordinates, renumbering please (and changing z terminator to , for all but last)
  15292        \memo used For fins, overhangs, elements that shade the building, are attached to the building
  15293        \memo but are not part of the heat transfer calculations
  15294        \format vertices
  15295        \min-fields 13
  15296   A1 , \field Name
  15297        \required-field
  15298        \type alpha
  15299        \reference AttachedShadingSurfNames
  15300        \reference AllShadingAndHTSurfNames
