  16409 ShadingProperty:Reflectance,
  16410        \min-fields 3
  16411        \memo If this object is not defined for a shading surface the default values
  16412        \memo listed in following fields will be used in the solar reflection calculation.
  16413   A1,  \field Shading Surface Name
  16414        \required-field
  16415        \type object-list
  16416        \object-list AllShadingSurfNames
  16417   N1,  \field Diffuse Solar Reflectance of Unglazed Part of Shading Surface
  16418        \minimum 0.0
  16419        \maximum 1.0
  16420        \default 0.2
  16421   N2,  \field Diffuse Visible Reflectance of Unglazed Part of Shading Surface
  16422        \minimum 0.0
  16423        \maximum 1.0
  16424        \default 0.2
  16425   N3,  \field Fraction of Shading Surface That Is Glazed
  16426        \minimum 0.0
  16427        \maximum 1.0
  16428        \default 0.0
  16429   A2;  \field Glazing Construction Name
  16430        \note Required if Fraction of Shading Surface That Is Glazed > 0.0
  16431 
  16432 \group Advanced Construction, Surface, Zone Concepts
  16433 
  16434 SurfaceProperty:HeatTransferAlgorithm,
  16435        \memo Determines which Heat Balance Algorithm will be used for a specific surface
  16436        \memo Allows selectively overriding the global setting in HeatBalanceAlgorithm
  16437        \memo CTF (Conduction Transfer Functions),
  16438        \memo EMPD (Effective Moisture Penetration Depth with Conduction Transfer Functions).
  16439        \memo Advanced/Research Usage: CondFD (Conduction Finite Difference)
  16440        \memo Advanced/Research Usage: HAMT (Combined Heat And Moisture Finite Element)
  16441        \min-fields 2
  16442   A1 , \field Surface Name
  16443        \required-field
  16444        \type object-list
  16445        \object-list SurfaceNames
  16446   A2 ; \field Algorithm
  16447        \type choice
  16448        \key ConductionTransferFunction
  16449        \key MoisturePenetrationDepthConductionTransferFunction
  16450        \key ConductionFiniteDifference
  16451        \key CombinedHeatAndMoistureFiniteElement
  16452        \default ConductionTransferFunction
  16453 
  16454 SurfaceProperty:HeatTransferAlgorithm:MultipleSurface,
