  16525 SurfaceProperty:HeatTransferAlgorithm:Construction,
  16526        \memo Determines which Heat Balance Algorithm will be used for surfaces that have a specific type of construction
  16527        \memo Allows selectively overriding the global setting in HeatBalanceAlgorithm
  16528        \memo CTF (Conduction Transfer Functions),
