  16547 SurfaceProperty:HeatBalanceSourceTerm,
  16548        \memo Allows an additional heat source term to be added to the inside or outside surface boundary.
  16549        \memo A heat source can be added to either or both the inside and outside of the same surface.
  16550        \min-fields 3
  16551   A1 , \field Surface Name
  16552        \required-field
  16553        \type object-list
  16554        \object-list SurfaceNames
  16555   A2 , \field Inside Face Heat Source Term Schedule Name
  16556        \type object-list
  16557        \object-list ScheduleNames
  16558        \note The value of this schedule is the source term value for the inside face of this surface
  16559        \note If this field is left blank, no inside surface source term will be applied.
  16560        \note The schedule values are heat rate per surface area (W/m2), when positive
  16561        \note schedule values indicate heat gain and negative values indicates loss.
  16562   A3 ; \field Outside Face Heat Source Term Schedule Name
  16563        \type object-list
  16564        \object-list ScheduleNames
  16565        \note The value of this schedule is the source term value for the outside face of this surface
  16566        \note If this field is left blank, no outside surface source term will be applied.
  16567        \note The schedule values are heat rate per surface area (W/m2), when positive
  16568        \note schedule values indicate heat gain and negative values indicates loss.
  16569 
