  17004 SurfaceProperty:ExposedFoundationPerimeter,
  17005        \memo Defines the perimeter of a foundation floor that is exposed to the
  17006        \memo exterior environment through the floor. User may either define the
  17007        \memo total exposed perimeter, fraction of perimeter exposed or
  17008        \memo individually define which segments of the floor surface perimeter
  17009        \memo are exposed.
  17010        \extensible:1
  17011   A1 , \field Surface Name
  17012        \required-field
  17013        \type object-list
  17014        \object-list FloorSurfaceNames
  17015   A2 , \field Exposed Perimeter Calculation Method
  17016        \note Choices: TotalExposedPerimeter => total exposed perimeter in meters
  17017        \note ExposedPerimeterFraction => fraction of total perimeter that is
  17018        \note exposed. Value * Fraction = Total exposed perimeter
  17019        \note BySegment => define whether the segment between each set of
  17020        \note consecutive vertices of the floor surface is exposed.
  17021        \note SUM(exposed segement lengths) = Total exposed perimeter
  17022        \required-field
  17023        \type choice
  17024        \key TotalExposedPerimeter
  17025        \key ExposedPerimeterFraction
  17026        \key BySegment
  17027   N1 , \field Total Exposed Perimeter
  17028        \type real
  17029        \units m
  17030        \minimum 0.0
  17031   N2 , \field Exposed Perimeter Fraction
  17032        \type real
  17033        \units dimensionless
  17034        \minimum 0.0
  17035        \maximum 1.0
  17036        \default 1.0
  17037   A3 , \field Surface Segment 1 Exposed
  17038        \note Surface Segment N is the perimeter between the Nth and (N+1)th
  17039        \note vertices
  17040        \begin-extensible
  17041        \type choice
  17042        \default Yes
  17043        \key Yes
  17044        \key No
  17045   A4 , \field Surface Segment 2 Exposed
  17046        \type choice
  17047        \key Yes
  17048        \key No
  17049   A5 , \field Surface Segment 3 Exposed
  17050        \type choice
  17051        \key Yes
  17052        \key No
  17053   A6 , \field Surface Segment 4 Exposed
  17054        \type choice
  17055        \key Yes
  17056        \key No
  17057   A7 , \field Surface Segment 5 Exposed
  17058        \type choice
  17059        \key Yes
  17060        \key No
  17061   A8 , \field Surface Segment 6 Exposed
  17062        \type choice
  17063        \key Yes
  17064        \key No
  17065   A9 , \field Surface Segment 7 Exposed
  17066        \type choice
  17067        \key Yes
  17068        \key No
  17069   A10, \field Surface Segment 8 Exposed
  17070        \type choice
  17071        \key Yes
  17072        \key No
  17073   A11, \field Surface Segment 9 Exposed
  17074        \type choice
  17075        \key Yes
  17076        \key No
  17077   A12; \field Surface Segment 10 Exposed
  17078        \type choice
  17079        \key Yes
  17080        \key No
