  17699 SurfaceConvectionAlgorithm:Outside:AdaptiveModelSelections,
  17700        \unique-object
  17701        \memo Options to change the individual convection model equations for dynamic selection when using AdaptiveConvectiongAlgorithm
  17702        \memo This object is only needed to make changes to the default model selections for any or all of the surface categories.
  17703        \memo This object is for the outside face, the side of the surface facing away from the thermal zone.
  17704        \min-fields 13
  17705   A1 , \field Name
  17706        \type alpha
  17707   A2 , \field Wind Convection Windward Vertical Wall Equation Source
  17708        \type choice
  17709        \default TARPWindward
  17710        \key SimpleCombined
  17711        \key TARPWindward
  17712        \key MoWiTTWindward
  17713        \key DOE2Windward
  17714        \key NusseltJurges
  17715        \key McAdams
  17716        \key Mitchell
  17717        \key BlockenWindward
  17718        \key EmmelVertical
  17719        \key UserCurve
