  17849        \note Curve's "x" is absolute value of delta-T/Height (Surface temp minus Air temp)/(vertical length scale), (C/m)
  17850        \note when used for an outside face the vertical length scale is the exterior facade's overall height
  17851        \type object-list
  17852        \object-list UnivariateFunctions
