  18145 SurfaceProperties:VaporCoefficients,
  18146       \memo The interior and external vapor transfer coefficients.
  18147       \memo Normally these value are calculated using the heat convection coefficient values.
  18148       \memo Use this object to used fixed constant values.
  18149       \memo Units are kg/Pa.s.m2
  18150       \memo This will only work with the CombinedHeatAndMoistureFiniteElement algorithm for surfaces.
  18151       \memo Other algorithms will ignore these coefficients
