  19815 RoomAir:TemperaturePattern:SurfaceMapping,
  19816       \memo Defines a distribution pattern for the air temperatures adjacent to individual surfaces.
  19817       \memo This allows controlling the adjacent air temperature on a surface-by-surface basis
  19818       \memo rather than by height. This allows modeling different adjacent air temperatures on
  19819       \memo the opposite sides of the zone. Used in combination with
  19820       \memo RoomAir:TemperaturePattern:UserDefined.
