  22307 DaylightingDevice:Tubular,
  22308        \memo Defines a tubular daylighting device (TDD) consisting of three components:
  22309        \memo a dome, a pipe, and a diffuser. The dome and diffuser are defined separately using the
  22310        \memo FenestrationSurface:Detailed object.
  22311        \extensible:2 Duplicate the last two fields Transition Zone Name and Transition Zone Length
  22312        \min-fields 7
