  22934 ZoneAirBalance:OutdoorAir,
  22935        \memo Provide a combined zone outdoor air flow by including interactions between
  22936        \memo mechanical ventilation, infiltration and duct leakage.
  22937        \memo This object will combine outdoor flows from all ZoneInfiltration and
  22938        \memo ZoneVentilation objects in the same zone. Balanced flows will be summed, while
  22939        \memo unbalanced flows will be added in quadrature.
  22940   A1 , \field Name
  22941        \required-field
  22942        \type alpha
  22943   A2 , \field Zone Name
  22944        \required-field
  22945        \type object-list
  22946        \object-list ZoneNames
  22947   A3 , \field Air Balance Method
  22948        \type choice
  22949        \key Quadrature
  22950        \key None
  22951        \default Quadrature
  22952        \note None: Only perform simple calculations without using a combined zone outdoor air.
  22953        \note Quadrature: A combined outdoor air is used in the quadrature sum.
  22954   N1 , \field Induced Outdoor Air Due to Unbalanced Duct Leakage
  22955        \units m3/s
  22956        \type real
  22957        \minimum 0
  22958        \default 0
  22959   A4 ; \field Induced Outdoor Air Schedule Name
  22960        \type object-list
  22961        \object-list ScheduleNames
  22962        \note This schedule contains the fraction values applied to the Induced Outdoor Air given in the
  22963        \note previous input field (0.0 - 1.0).
  22964 
  22965 ZoneMixing,
  22966        \memo ZoneMixing is a simple air exchange from one zone to another. Note that this statement
  22967        \memo only affects the energy balance of the "receiving" zone and will not produce
  22968        \memo any effect on the "source" zone. Mixing statements can be complementary and include
  22969        \memo multiple zones, but the balancing of flows between zones is left to the user's
  22970        \memo discretion.
  22971  \min-fields 9
  22972   A1 , \field Name
  22973        \required-field
  22974        \type alpha
  22975   A2 , \field Zone Name
  22976        \required-field
