  22985        \note for this set of attributes
  22986        \note Choices: Flow/Zone => Design Flow Rate -- simply enter Design Flow Rate
  22987        \note Flow/Area => Flow Rate per Zone Floor Area - Value * Floor Area (zone) = Design Flow Rate
  22988        \note Flow/Person => Flow Rate per Person - Value * #people = Design Flow Rate
  22989        \note AirChanges/Hour => Air Changes per Hour - Value * Floor Volume (zone) adjusted for m3/s = Design Volume Flow Rate
  22990        \note  "Vdesign" in Equation is the result.
  22991        \type choice
  22992        \key Flow/Zone
  22993        \key Flow/Area
  22994        \key Flow/Person
  22995        \key AirChanges/Hour
  22996        \default Flow/Zone
