  23206       \memo  Earth Tube is specified as a design level which is modified by a Schedule fraction, temperature difference and wind speed:
  23207       \memo  Earthtube=Edesign * Fschedule * (A + B*|(Tzone-Todb)| + C*WindSpd + D * WindSpd**2)
