  24412       \note Used only when opening (window or door) is closed.
  24413  N3 , \field Minimum Density Difference for Two-Way Flow
  24414       \required-field
  24415       \units kg/m3
  24416       \type real
  24417       \minimum> 0
  24418       \note Enter the minimum density difference above which two-way flow may occur due to stack effect.
  24419  N4 ; \field Discharge Coefficient
  24420       \required-field
  24421       \units dimensionless
  24422       \type real
  24423       \minimum> 0
  24424       \note The Discharge Coefficient indicates the fractional effectiveness
  24425       \note for air flow through a window or door at that Opening Factor.
  24426 
  24427 AirflowNetwork:MultiZone:Component:HorizontalOpening,
