  24446       \default .65
  24447       \minimum 0.5
  24448       \maximum 1.0
  24449       \note Enter the exponent used in the following equation:
  24450       \note Mass flow rate = Air Mass Flow Coefficient * (dP)^Air Mass Flow Exponent.
  24451       \note Used only when opening is closed.
  24452  N3 , \field Sloping Plane Angle
  24453       \units deg
  24454       \type real
  24455       \minimum> 0
  24456       \maximum 90
  24457       \default 90
  24458       \note Sloping plane angle = 90 is equivalent to fully open.
  24459  N4 ; \field Discharge Coefficient
  24460       \required-field
  24461       \units dimensionless
  24462       \type real
  24463       \minimum> 0
  24464       \note The Discharge Coefficient indicates the fractional effectiveness
  24465       \note for air flow through the opening at that Opening Factor.
  24466 
  24467 AirflowNetwork:MultiZone:Component:ZoneExhaustFan,
  24468       \min-fields 3
  24469       \memo This object specifies the additional properties for a zone exhaust fan
  24470       \memo to perform multizone airflow calculations.
  24471  A1 , \field Name
  24472       \required-field
