  26073       \default Flow/Person
  26074   N3, \field Outdoor Air Flow Rate per Person
  26075       \units m3/s
  26076       \note Default 0.00944 is 20 cfm per person
  26077       \note This input is used if the field Outdoor Air Method is
  26078       \note Flow/Person, Sum, or Maximum
  26079       \default 0.00944
  26080   N4, \field Outdoor Air Flow Rate per Zone Floor Area
  26081       \units m3/s-m2
  26082       \default 0.0
  26083       \note This input is used if the field Outdoor Air Method is
  26084       \note Flow/Area, Sum, or Maximum
  26085   N5, \field Outdoor Air Flow Rate per Zone
  26086       \type real
  26087       \units m3/s
  26088       \default 0.0
  26089       \note This input is used if the field Outdoor Air Method is
  26090       \note Flow/Zone, Sum, or Maximum
  26091   A7, \field Design Specification Outdoor Air Object name
  26092       \note This field is used only when Outdoor Air Method=DetailedSpecification.
  26093       \type object-list
  26094       \object-list DesignSpecificationOutdoorAirNames
  26095   A8; \field Design Specification Zone Air Distribution Object Name
