  26382       \note Refers to a schedule to specify unitary supply fan operating mode.
  26383       \note Schedule Name values of 0 indicate cycling fan (auto)
  26384       \note Schedule values of 1 indicate continuous fan (on)
  26385       \note If this field is left blank, a schedule of always zero (cycling fan) will be used.
  26386       \type object-list
  26387       \object-list ScheduleNames
  26388   A6, \field Supply Fan Placement
