  28954       \note None = meet sensible cooling load only
  28955       \note CoolReheatHeatingCoil = cool beyond the dry-bulb setpoint
  28956       \note as required to meet the humidity setpoint, reheat with main heating coil.
  28957       \note CoolReheatDesuperheater = cool beyond the dry-bulb setpoint
  28958       \note as required to meet the humidity setpoint, reheat with desuperheater coil.
