  29385 HVACTemplate:System:UnitarySystem,
  29386       \min-fields 71
  29387       \memo Unitary HVAC system with optional cooling and heating. Supports DX and chilled water,
  29388       \memo cooling, gas, electric, and hot water heating, air-to-air and water-to-air heat pumps.
  29389   A1, \field Name
  29390       \required-field
  29391       \reference CompactHVACSystemUnitary
  29392       \reference HVACTemplateSystems
  29393   A2, \field System Availability Schedule Name
  29394       \note If blank, always available. Also see Supply Fan Operating Mode Schedule Name field.
  29395       \type object-list
  29396       \object-list ScheduleNames
  29397   A3,  \field Control Type
  29398        \type choice
  29399        \key Load
  29400        \key SetPoint
  29401        \default Load
  29402        \note Load control requires a Controlling Zone name.
  29403        \note SetPoint control requires set points at coil outlet nodes. The user must add appropriate
  29404        \note SetpointManager objects to the idf file.
  29405   A4, \field Control Zone or Thermostat Location Name
  29406       \note This field is required if Control Type is Load.
  29407       \type object-list
  29408       \object-list ZoneNames
  29409   N1, \field Cooling Supply Air Flow Rate
  29410       \note Supply air flow rate during cooling operation
  29411       \note This field may be set to "autosize".  If a value is entered, it will *not* be
  29412       \note multiplied by any sizing factor or by zone multipliers.  If using zone multipliers
  29413       \note a value entered here must be large enough to serve the multiplied zones.
  29414       \type real
  29415       \minimum> 0.0
  29416       \autosizable
  29417       \default autosize
  29418       \units m3/s
