  29432       \note is used when no heating or cooling is required and the DX coil compressor is off.
  29433       \note If this field is left blank or zero, the supply air flow rate from the previous on cycle
  29434       \note (either cooling or heating) is used.
  29435       \note This field may be set to "autosize".  If a value is entered, it will *not* be
