  31862 HVACTemplate:Plant:Chiller,
  31863       \min-fields 7
  31864       \memo This object adds a chiller to an HVACTemplate:Plant:ChilledWaterLoop.
  31865   A1, \field Name
  31866       \required-field
  31867   A2, \field Chiller Type
  31868       \required-field
  31869       \type choice
  31870       \key DistrictChilledWater
  31871       \key ElectricCentrifugalChiller
  31872       \key ElectricScrewChiller
  31873       \key ElectricReciprocatingChiller
  31874   N1, \field Capacity
  31875       \autosizable
  31876       \default autosize
  31877       \units W
  31878       \minimum> 0.0
  31879   N2, \field Nominal COP
  31880       \required-field
  31881       \note Not applicable if Chiller Type is DistrictChilledWater
  31882       \note Electric Reciprocating Chiller
  31883       \units W/W
  31884       \minimum> 0.0
  31885   A3, \field Condenser Type
  31886       \note Not applicable if Chiller Type is DistrictChilledWater
  31887       \type choice
  31888       \key AirCooled
  31889       \key WaterCooled
  31890       \key EvaporativelyCooled
  31891       \default WaterCooled
  31892   A4, \field Priority
  31893       \note If Chiller Plant Operation Scheme Type=Default
  31894       \note in HVACTemplate:Plant:ChilledWaterLoop, then equipment
  31895       \note operates in Priority order, 1, 2, 3, etc.
  31896   N3, \field Sizing Factor
  31897       \note Multiplies the autosized capacity and flow rates
  31898       \type real
  31899       \minimum> 0.0
  31900       \default 1.0
  31901   N4, \field Minimum Part Load Ratio
  31902       \type real
  31903       \note Part load ratio below which the chiller starts cycling on/off to meet the load.
  31904       \note Must be less than or equal to Maximum Part Load Ratio.
  31905       \minimum 0.0
  31906       \default 0.0
  31907   N5, \field Maximum Part Load Ratio
  31908       \type real
  31909       \note Maximum allowable part load ratio. Must be greater than or equal to Minimum Part Load Ratio.
  31910       \minimum> 0.0
  31911       \default 1.0
  31912   N6, \field Optimum Part Load Ratio
  31913       \type real
  31914       \note Optimum part load ratio where the chiller is most efficient.
  31915       \note Must be greater than or equal to the Minimum Part Load Ratio
  31916       \note and less than or equal to the Maximum Part Load Ratio.
  31917       \minimum> 0.0
  31918       \default 1.0
  31919   N7, \field Minimum Unloading Ratio
  31920       \type real
  31921       \note Part load ratio where the chiller can no longer unload and false loading begins.
  31922       \note Minimum unloading ratio must be greater than or equal to the Minimum Part Load Ratio
  31923       \note and less than or equal to the Maximum Part Load Ratio.
  31924       \minimum 0.0
  31925       \default 0.25
  31926   N8; \field Leaving Chilled Water Lower Temperature Limit
  31927       \type real
  31928       \default 5.0
  31929       \units C
  31930 
