  32821       \note This field may be blank if a heating coil is not included in the Zone HVAC equipment.
  32822  N12, \field Heating Supply Air Flow Rate Per Unit Heating Capacity
  32823       \type real
  32824       \units m3/s-W
  32825       \minimum 0.0
  32826       \note Enter the supply air volume flow rate per unit heating capacity.
  32827       \note Required field when Heating Supply Air Flow Rate Method is
  32828       \note FlowPerHeatingCapacity.
  32829       \note This field may be blank if a heating coil is not included in the Zone HVAC equipment.
  32830   A5, \field Cooling Design Capacity Method
  32831       \type choice
  32832       \key None
  32833       \key CoolingDesignCapacity
  32834       \key CapacityPerFloorArea
  32835       \key FractionOfAutosizedCoolingCapacity
  32836       \default None
  32837       \note Enter the method used to determine the cooling design capacity for scalable sizing.
  32838       \note None is used when a cooling coils is not included in the Zone HVAC Equipment or
  32839       \note this field may be blank. If this input field is left blank, then the design cooling
  32840       \note capacity is set to zero. CoolingDesignCapacity => selected when the design cooling capacity
  32841       \note value is specified or auto-sized. CapacityPerFloorArea => selected when the design cooling
  32842       \note capacity is determine from user specified cooling capacity per floor area and zone floor area.
  32843       \note FractionOfAutosizedCoolingCapacity => is selected when the design cooling capacity is
  32844       \note determined from a user specified fraction and the auto-sized design cooling capacity.
  32845  N13, \field Cooling Design Capacity
  32846       \type real
  32847       \units W
  32848       \minimum 0.0
  32849       \autosizable
  32850       \note Enter the design cooling capacity. Required field when the cooling design capacity method
  32851       \note CoolingDesignCapacity.
  32852  N14, \field Cooling Design Capacity Per Floor Area
  32853       \type real
  32854       \units W/m2
  32855       \minimum 0.0
  32856       \note Enter the cooling design capacity per zone floor area. Required field when the cooling design
  32857       \note capacity method field is CapacityPerFloorArea.
  32858  N15, \field Fraction of Autosized Cooling Design Capacity
