  32873       \note capacity is set to zero. HeatingDesignCapacity => selected when the design heating capacity
  32874       \note value is specified or auto-sized. CapacityPerFloorArea => selected when the design cooling
  32875       \note capacity is determine from user specified heating capacity per flow area and zone floor area.
  32876       \note FractionOfAutosizedHeatingCapacity => is selected when the design heating capacity is
  32877       \note determined from a user specified fraction and the auto-sized design heating capacity
  32878  N16, \field Heating Design Capacity
  32879       \type real
  32880       \units W
  32881       \minimum 0.0
  32882       \autosizable
  32883       \note Enter the design heating capacity. Required field when the heating design capacity method
  32884       \note HeatingDesignCapacity.
