  32921       \note This fraction is applied after the Zone Heating Sizing Factor (see Sizing:Zone).
  32922       \type real
  32923       \units dimensionless
  32924       \minimum 0.0
  32925       \default 1.0
  32926   N4, \field Heating Design Supply Air Temperature Difference Ratio
  32927       \note This ratio adjusts the supply air temperature difference used to calculate
  32928       \note the heating design supply air flow rate for this terminal unit.
