  32930       \units dimensionless
  32931       \minimum> 0.0
  32932       \default 1.0
  32933   N5; \field Fraction of Minimum Outdoor Air Flow
  32934       \note The fraction of the zone minimum outdoor air requirement to be met by this terminal unit.
