  32940 Sizing:System,
  32941       \memo Specifies the input needed to perform sizing calculations for a central forced air
  32942       \memo system. System design air flow, heating capacity, and cooling capacity will be calculated
  32943       \memo using this input data.
  32944       \min-fields 37
  32945   A1, \field AirLoop Name
  32946       \required-field
  32947       \type object-list
  32948       \object-list AirPrimaryLoops
  32949   A2, \field Type of Load to Size On
  32950       \note Specifies the basis for sizing the system supply air flow rate
  32951       \note Sensible and Total use the zone design air flow rates to size the system supply air flow rate
  32952       \note The cooling coil will then be sized at either the peak Sensible or Total flow rate and conditions
  32953       \note The heating coil is always sized at the peak sensible heating load.
  32954       \note VentilationRequirement uses the system ventilation requirement
  32955       \type choice
  32956       \key Sensible
  32957       \key Total
  32958       \key VentilationRequirement
  32959       \default Sensible
  32960   N1, \field Design Outdoor Air Flow Rate
  32961       \type real
  32962       \default autosize
  32963       \minimum 0.0
  32964       \units m3/s
  32965       \autosizable
  32966   N2, \field Central Heating Maximum System Air Flow Ratio
  32967       \type real
  32968       \minimum 0.0
  32969       \maximum 1.0
  32970       \default autosize
  32971       \autosizable
  32972   N3, \field Preheat Design Temperature
