  33038       \minimum 0.0
  33039       \note Enter the cooling supply air volume flow rate per total conditioned floor area.
  33040       \note Required field when Cooling Supply Air Flow Rate Method is FlowPerFloorArea.
  33041  N13, \field Cooling Fraction of Autosized Cooling Supply Air Flow Rate
  33042       \type real
  33043       \minimum 0.0
  33044       \note Enter the supply air volume flow rate as a fraction of the cooling supply air flow rate.
  33045       \note Required field when Cooling Supply Air Flow Rate Method is
  33046       \note FractionOfAutosizedCoolingAirflow.
  33047  N14, \field Cooling Supply Air Flow Rate Per Unit Cooling Capacity
  33048       \type real
  33049       \units m3/s-W
  33050       \minimum 0.0
  33051       \note Enter the supply air volume flow rate per unit cooling capacity.
  33052       \note Required field when Cooling Supply Air Flow Rate Method is
  33053       \note FlowPerCoolingCapacity.
  33054   A7, \field Heating Supply Air Flow Rate Method
  33055       \type choice
  33056       \key Flow/System
  33057       \key DesignDay
  33058       \key FlowPerFloorArea
  33059       \key FractionOfAutosizedHeatingAirflow
  33060       \key FractionOfAutosizedCoolingAirflow
  33061       \key FlowPerHeatingCapacity
  33062       \default DesignDay
