  33069       \minimum 0
  33070       \default 0
  33071  N16, \field Heating Supply Air Flow Rate Per Floor Area
  33072       \type real
  33073       \units m3/s-m2
  33074       \minimum 0.0
  33075       \note Enter the heating supply air volume flow rate per total conditioned floor area.
  33076       \note Required field when Heating Supply Air Flow Rate Method is FlowPerFloorArea.
  33077  N17, \field Heating Fraction of Autosized Heating Supply Air Flow Rate
  33078       \type real
  33079       \minimum 0.0
  33080       \note Enter the supply air volume flow rate as a fraction of the heating supply air flow rate.
  33081       \note Required field when Heating Supply Air Flow Rate Method is
  33082       \note FractionOfAutosizedHeatingAirflow.
  33083  N18, \field Heating Fraction of Autosized Cooling Supply Air Flow Rate
  33084       \type real
  33085       \minimum 0.0
  33086       \note Enter the supply air volume flow rate as a fraction of the cooling supply air flow rate.
  33087       \note Required field when Heating Supply Air Flow Rate Method is
  33088       \note FractionOfAutosizedCoolingAirflow.
  33089  N19, \field Heating Supply Air Flow Rate Per Unit Heating Capacity
  33090       \type real
  33091       \units m3/s-W
  33092       \minimum 0.0
  33093       \note Enter the heating supply air volume flow rate per unit heating capacity.
  33094       \note Required field when Heating Supply Air Flow Rate Method is
  33095       \note FlowPerHeatingCapacity.
  33096   A8, \field System Outdoor Air Method
  33097       \type choice
  33098       \key ZoneSum
  33099       \key VentilationRateProcedure
  33100       \default ZoneSum
  33101  N20, \field Zone Maximum Outdoor Air Fraction
  33102       \type real
  33103       \default 1.0
  33104       \minimum> 0.0
  33105       \units dimensionless
  33106   A9, \field Cooling Design Capacity Method
  33107       \type choice
  33108       \key None
  33109       \key CoolingDesignCapacity
  33110       \key CapacityPerFloorArea
  33111       \key FractionOfAutosizedCoolingCapacity
  33112       \default CoolingDesignCapacity
  33113       \note Enter the method used to determine the system cooling design capacity for scalable sizing.
  33114       \note None is used when a cooling coils is not included in an airloop or this field may be blank.
  33115       \note If this input field is left blank, then the design cooling capacity is set to zero.
  33116       \note CoolingDesignCapacity => selected when the design cooling capacity value is specified or
  33117       \note auto-sized. CapacityPerFloorArea => selected when the design cooling capacity is determined
  33118       \note from user specified cooling capacity per floor area and total floor area of cooled zones
  33119       \note served by an airloop. FractionOfAutosizedCoolingCapacity => is selected when the design
  33120       \note cooling capacity is determined from a user specified fraction and the auto-sized design
  33121       \note cooling capacity of the system.
  33122  N21, \field Cooling Design Capacity
  33123       \type real
  33124       \units W
  33125       \minimum 0.0
  33126       \autosizable
  33127       \default autosize
  33128       \note Enter the design cooling capacity.
  33129  N22, \field Cooling Design Capacity Per Floor Area
  33130       \type real
  33131       \units W/m2
  33132       \minimum 0.0
  33133       \note Enter the cooling design capacity per total floor area of cooled zones served by an airloop.
  33134       \note Required field when the cooling design capacity method field is CapacityPerFloorArea.
  33135  N23, \field Fraction of Autosized Cooling Design Capacity
  33136       \type real
  33137       \minimum 0.0
  33138       \note Enter the fraction of auto-sized cooling design capacity. Required field when the cooling
  33139       \note design capacity method field is FractionOfAutosizedCoolingCapacity.
  33140  A10, \field Heating Design Capacity Method
