  33142       \key None
  33143       \key HeatingDesignCapacity
  33144       \key CapacityPerFloorArea
  33145       \key FractionOfAutosizedHeatingCapacity
  33146       \default HeatingDesignCapacity
  33147       \note Enter the method used to determine the heating design capacity for scalable sizing.
  33148       \note None is used when a heating coil not included in an airloop or this field may be blank.
  33149       \note If this input field is left blank, then the design heating capacity is set to zero.
  33150       \note HeatingDesignCapacity => selected when the design heating capacity value is specified or
  33151       \note auto-sized. CapacityPerFloorArea => selected when the design heating capacity is determined
  33152       \note from user specified heating capacity per flow area and total floor area of heated zones
  33153       \note served by an airloop. FractionOfAutosizedHeatingCapacity => is selected when the design
  33154       \note heating capacity is determined from a user specified fraction and the auto-sized design
  33155       \note heating capacity of the system.
  33156  N24, \field Heating Design Capacity
  33157       \type real
  33158       \units W
  33159       \minimum 0.0
  33160       \autosizable
  33161       \default autosize
  33162       \note Enter the design heating capacity.
  33163  N25, \field Heating Design Capacity Per Floor Area
  33164       \type real
  33165       \units W/m2
  33166       \minimum 0.0
  33167       \note Enter the heating design capacity per zone floor area. Required field when the heating design
  33168       \note capacity method field is CapacityPerFloorArea.
  33169  N26, \field Fraction of Autosized Heating Design Capacity
  33170       \type real
  33171       \minimum 0.0
  33172       \note Enter the fraction of auto-sized heating design capacity. Required field when capacity the
  33173       \note heating design capacity method field is FractionOfAutosizedHeatingCapacity.
  33174  A11; \field Central Cooling Capacity Control Method
  33175       \note Method used to control the coil's output
  33176       \type choice
  33177       \key VAV
  33178       \key Bypass
  33179       \key VT
  33180       \key OnOff
  33181       \default OnOff
