  33266 ZoneControl:Thermostat,
  33267    \memo Define the Thermostat settings for a zone or list of zones.
  33268    \memo If you use a ZoneList in the Zone or ZoneList name field then this definition applies
  33269    \memo to all the zones in the ZoneList.
  33270   A1 , \field Name
  33271        \required-field
  33272        \reference ZoneControlThermostaticNames
  33273   A2 , \field Zone or ZoneList Name
  33274        \required-field
  33275        \type object-list
  33276        \object-list ZoneAndZoneListNames
  33277   A3 , \field Control Type Schedule Name
  33278        \note This schedule contains appropriate control types for thermostat.
  33279        \note Control types are integers: 0 - Uncontrolled (floating, no thermostat), 1 = ThermostatSetpoint:SingleHeating,
  33280        \note 2 = ThermostatSetpoint:SingleCooling, 3 = ThermostatSetpoint:SingleHeatingOrCooling, 4 = ThermostatSetpoint:DualSetpoint
  33281        \required-field
  33282        \type object-list
  33283        \object-list ScheduleNames
  33284   A4 , \field Control 1 Object Type
  33285        \required-field
  33286        \type choice
  33287        \key ThermostatSetpoint:SingleHeating
  33288        \key ThermostatSetpoint:SingleCooling
  33289        \key ThermostatSetpoint:SingleHeatingOrCooling
  33290        \key ThermostatSetpoint:DualSetpoint
  33291   A5 , \field Control 1 Name
  33292        \note Control names are names of individual control objects (e.g. ThermostatSetpoint:SingleHeating)
  33293        \note Schedule values in these objects list actual setpoint temperatures for the control types
  33294        \required-field
  33295        \type object-list
  33296        \object-list ControlTypeNames
  33297   A6 , \field Control 2 Object Type
  33298        \type choice
  33299        \key ThermostatSetpoint:SingleHeating
  33300        \key ThermostatSetpoint:SingleCooling
  33301        \key ThermostatSetpoint:SingleHeatingOrCooling
  33302        \key ThermostatSetpoint:DualSetpoint
  33303   A7 , \field Control 2 Name
  33304        \note Control names are names of individual control objects (e.g. ThermostatSetpoint:SingleHeating)
  33305        \note Schedule values in these objects list actual setpoint temperatures for the control types
  33306        \type object-list
  33307        \object-list ControlTypeNames
  33308   A8 , \field Control 3 Object Type
  33309        \type choice
  33310        \key ThermostatSetpoint:SingleHeating
  33311        \key ThermostatSetpoint:SingleCooling
  33312        \key ThermostatSetpoint:SingleHeatingOrCooling
  33313        \key ThermostatSetpoint:DualSetpoint
  33314   A9 , \field Control 3 Name
  33315        \note Control names are names of individual control objects (e.g. ThermostatSetpoint:SingleHeating)
  33316        \note Schedule values in these objects list actual setpoint temperatures for the control types
  33317        \type object-list
  33318        \object-list ControlTypeNames
  33319   A10, \field Control 4 Object Type
  33320        \type choice
  33321        \key ThermostatSetpoint:SingleHeating
  33322        \key ThermostatSetpoint:SingleCooling
  33323        \key ThermostatSetpoint:SingleHeatingOrCooling
  33324        \key ThermostatSetpoint:DualSetpoint
  33325   A11, \field Control 4 Name
  33326        \note Control names are names of individual control objects (e.g. ThermostatSetpoint:SingleHeating)
  33327        \note Schedule values in these objects list actual setpoint temperatures for the control types
  33328        \type object-list
  33329        \object-list ControlTypeNames
  33330   N1 ; \field Temperature Difference Between Cutout And Setpoint
  33331        \note This optional choice field provides a temperature difference between cut-out temperature and
  33332        \note setpoint. The difference is used to adjust to heating or cooling setpoint based on control types.
  33333        \units deltaC
  33334        \type real
  33335        \minimum 0.0
  33336        \default 0.0
