  34060         \note For CyclingFan a Fan:OnOff is valid.
  34061         \note For VariableFanVariableFlow or VariableFanConstantFlow a Fan:VariableVolume is valid.
  34062         \note For ASHRAE90.1 a Fan:OnOff or Fan:VariableVolume is valid.
  34063         \note Fan:SystemModel is valid for all capacity control methods.
  34064         \note The fan's inlet node should be the same as the outdoor air mixer's mixed air node.
