  34127         \note Enter the name of a schedule that controls fan operation. Schedule Name values of 0 denote
  34128         \note cycling fan operation (fan cycles with cooling coil). Schedule values greater
  34129         \note than 0 denote constant fan operation (fan runs continually regardless of coil operation).
  34130         \note The fan operating mode defaults to cycling fan operation if this field is left blank.
