  34239 ZoneHVAC:PackagedTerminalAirConditioner,
  34240         \memo Packaged terminal air conditioner (PTAC).  Forced-convection heating-cooling unit
  34241         \memo with supply fan, direct expansion (DX) cooling coil, heating coil (gas, electric, hot
  34242         \memo water, or steam) and fixed-position outdoor air mixer.
