  34266         \key OutdoorAir:Mixer
  34267         \note Currently only one OutdoorAir:Mixer object type is available.
  34268         \note This field should be left blank if the PTAC is connected to central
  34269         \note dedicated outdoor air through an AirTerminal:SingleDuct:Mixer object.
  34270    A6 , \field Outdoor Air Mixer Name
  34271         \type object-list
  34272         \object-list OutdoorAirMixers
  34273         \note If this field is blank, the OutdoorAir:Mixer is not used.
  34274         \note This optional field specifies the name of the OutdoorAir:Mixer object.
  34275         \note When used, this name needs to match name of the OutdoorAir:Mixer object.
  34276         \note This field should be left blank if the PTAC is connected to central
  34277         \note dedicated outdoor air through an AirTerminal:SingleDuct:Mixer object.
  34278    N1 , \field Cooling Supply Air Flow Rate
  34279         \required-field
  34280         \type real
  34281         \units m3/s
  34282         \minimum> 0.0
  34283         \autosizable
  34284         \note Must be less than or equal to fan size.
  34285    N2 , \field Heating Supply Air Flow Rate
  34286         \required-field
  34287         \type real
  34288         \units m3/s
  34289         \minimum> 0.0
  34290         \autosizable
  34291         \note Must be less than or equal to fan size.
  34292    N3 , \field No Load Supply Air Flow Rate
  34293         \type real
  34294         \units m3/s
  34295         \minimum 0
  34296         \autosizable
  34297         \note Must be less than or equal to fan size.
  34298         \note Only used when supply air fan operating mode schedule values specify continuous fan
  34299         \note (schedule values greater than 0 specify continuous fan operation).
  34300         \note This air flow rate is used when no heating or cooling is required and the cooling or
  34301         \note heating coil is off. If this field is left blank or zero, the supply air flow rate
  34302         \note from the previous on cycle (either cooling or heating) is used.
  34303    N4 , \field Cooling Outdoor Air Flow Rate
  34304         \required-field
  34305         \type real
  34306         \units m3/s
  34307         \minimum 0
  34308         \autosizable
  34309         \note Must be less than or equal to supply air flow rate during cooling operation.
  34310         \note This field is set to zero flow when the PTAC is connected to central
  34311         \note dedicated outdoor air through air terminal single duct mixer object.
  34312    N5 , \field Heating Outdoor Air Flow Rate
  34313         \required-field
  34314         \type real
  34315         \units m3/s
  34316         \minimum 0
  34317         \autosizable
  34318         \note Must be less than or equal to supply air flow rate during heating operation.
  34319         \note This field is set to zero flow when the PTAC is connected to central
  34320         \note dedicated outdoor air through air terminal single duct mixer object.
  34321    N6 , \field No Load Outdoor Air Flow Rate
  34322         \type real
  34323         \units m3/s
  34324         \minimum 0
  34325         \autosizable
  34326         \note Only used when supply air fan operating mode schedule values specify continuous fan
  34327         \note (schedule values greater than 0 specify continuous fan operation).
  34328         \note This air flow rate is used when no heating or cooling is required and the cooling or
  34329         \note heating coil is off. If this field is left blank or zero, the outdoor air flow rate
  34330         \note from the previous on cycle (either cooling or heating) is used.
  34331         \note This field is set to zero flow when the PTAC is connected to central
  34332         \note dedicated outdoor air through air terminal single duct mixer object.
  34333    A7 , \field Supply Air Fan Object Type
  34334         \required-field
  34335         \type choice
  34336         \key Fan:SystemModel
  34337         \key Fan:OnOff
  34338         \key Fan:ConstantVolume
  34339         \note Fan:ConstantVolume only works when continuous fan operation is used the entire
  34340         \note simulation (all supply air fan operating mode schedule values are greater than 0).
  34341         \note If any fan operating mode schedule values are 0 a Fan:SystemModel or Fan:OnOff object must be used.
  34342    A8 , \field Supply Air Fan Name
  34343         \required-field
  34344         \type object-list
  34345         \object-list FansCVandOnOff
  34346         \object-list FansSystemModel
  34347         \note Needs to match in the fan object.
  34348    A9 , \field Heating Coil Object Type
  34349         \required-field
  34350         \type choice
  34351         \key Coil:Heating:Fuel
  34352         \key Coil:Heating:Electric
  34353         \key Coil:Heating:Water
  34354         \key Coil:Heating:Steam
  34355         \note Select the type of heating coil.
