  34417 ZoneHVAC:PackagedTerminalHeatPump,
  34418         \memo Packaged terminal heat pump (PTHP). Forced-convection heating-cooling unit with
  34419         \memo supply fan, direct expansion (DX) cooling coil, DX heating coil (air-to-air heat
  34420         \memo pump), supplemental heating coil (gas, electric, hot water, or steam), and
  34421         \memo fixed-position outdoor air mixer.
  34422         \min-fields 26
  34423    A1,  \field Name
  34424         \required-field
  34425         \type alpha
  34426         \reference DOAToZonalUnit
  34427         \reference ZoneEquipmentNames
  34428         \note Unique name for this packaged terminal heat pump object.
  34429    A2,  \field Availability Schedule Name
