  34445         \key OutdoorAir:Mixer
  34446         \note Currently only one OutdoorAir:Mixer object type is available.
  34447         \note This field should be left blank if the PTHP is connected to central
  34448         \note dedicated outdoor air through an AirTerminal:SingleDuct:Mixer object.
