  34454         \note When used, this name needs to match name of the OutdoorAir:Mixer object.
  34455         \note This field should be left blank if the PTHP is connected to central
  34456         \note dedicated outdoor air through an AirTerminal:SingleDuct:Mixer object.
  34457    N1 , \field Cooling Supply Air Flow Rate
  34458         \required-field
  34459         \type real
  34460         \units m3/s
  34461         \minimum> 0.0
  34462         \autosizable
  34463         \note Must be less than or equal to fan size.
  34464    N2 , \field Heating Supply Air Flow Rate
  34465         \required-field
  34466         \type real
  34467         \units m3/s
  34468         \minimum> 0.0
  34469         \autosizable
  34470         \note Must be less than or equal to fan size.
  34471    N3 , \field No Load Supply Air Flow Rate
  34472         \type real
  34473         \units m3/s
  34474         \minimum 0
  34475         \autosizable
  34476         \note Must be less than or equal to fan size.
  34477         \note Only used when heat pump fan operating mode is continuous. This air flow rate
  34478         \note is used when no heating or cooling is required and the DX coil compressor is off.
  34479         \note If this field is left blank or zero, the supply air flow rate from the previous
  34480         \note on cycle (either cooling or heating) is used.
  34481    N4 , \field Cooling Outdoor Air Flow Rate
  34482         \required-field
  34483         \type real
