  34488         \note This field is set to zero flow when the PTHP is connected to central
  34489         \note dedicated outdoor air through air terminal single duct mixer object.
  34490    N5 , \field Heating Outdoor Air Flow Rate
  34491         \required-field
  34492         \type real
  34493         \units m3/s
  34494         \minimum 0
  34495         \autosizable
  34496         \note Must be less than or equal to supply air flow rate during heating operation.
  34497         \note This field is set to zero flow when the PTHP is connected to central
  34498         \note dedicated outdoor air through air terminal single duct mixer object.
  34499    N6 , \field No Load Outdoor Air Flow Rate
  34500         \type real
  34501         \units m3/s
  34502         \minimum 0
  34503         \autosizable
  34504         \note Only used when heat pump Fan operating mode is continuous. This air flow rate
  34505         \note is used when no heating or cooling is required and the DX coil compressor is off.
  34506         \note If this field is left blank or zero, the outdoor air flow rate from the previous
  34507         \note on cycle (either cooling or heating) is used.
  34508         \note This field is set to zero flow when the PTHP is connected to central
  34509         \note dedicated outdoor air through air terminal single duct mixer object.
