  40489 ZoneHVAC:TerminalUnit:VariableRefrigerantFlow,
  40490         \memo A terminal unit with variable refrigerant flow (VRF) DX cooling and heating coils
  40491         \memo (air-to-air heat pump). The VRF terminal units are served by an
  40492         \memo AirConditioner:VariableRefrigerantFlow or
  40493         \memo AirConditioner:VariableRefrigerantFlow:FluidTemperatureControl:* system.
  40494         \memo Terminal units can be configured as zone, air loop or outside air system equipment.
  40495         \min-fields 19
  40496   A1 ,  \field Zone Terminal Unit Name
  40497         \required-field
  40498         \type alpha
  40499         \reference ZoneTerminalUnitNames
  40500         \reference DOAToZonalUnit
  40501         \reference ZoneEquipmentNames
  40502         \reference-class-name validBranchEquipmentTypes
  40503         \reference validBranchEquipmentNames
  40504         \reference-class-name validOASysEquipmentTypes
  40505         \reference validOASysEquipmentNames
  40506   A2 ,  \field Terminal Unit Availability Schedule
  40507         \type object-list
  40508         \object-list ScheduleNames
  40509         \note The unit is available the entire simulation if this field is left blank
  40510         \note Schedule values of 0 denote the unit is off.
  40511   A3 ,  \field Terminal Unit Air Inlet Node Name
  40512         \required-field
  40513         \type node
  40514         \note the inlet node to the terminal unit
  40515   A4 ,  \field Terminal Unit Air Outlet Node Name
  40516         \required-field
  40517         \type node
  40518         \note the outlet node of the terminal unit
  40519   N1 ,  \field Cooling Supply Air Flow Rate
  40520         \type real
  40521         \units m3/s
  40522         \minimum> 0.0
  40523         \autosizable
  40524   N2 ,  \field No Cooling Supply Air Flow Rate
  40525         \type real
  40526         \units m3/s
  40527         \minimum 0.0
  40528         \autosizable
  40529   N3 ,  \field Heating Supply Air Flow Rate
  40530         \type real
  40531         \units m3/s
  40532         \minimum> 0.0
  40533         \autosizable
  40534   N4 ,  \field No Heating Supply Air Flow Rate
  40535         \type real
  40536         \units m3/s
  40537         \minimum 0.0
  40538         \autosizable
  40539   N5 ,  \field Cooling Outdoor Air Flow Rate
  40540         \type real
  40541         \units m3/s
  40542         \minimum 0.0
  40543         \autosizable
  40544         \note This field is used only when an oudoor air mixer is included.
  40545         \note This field is set to zero flow when the VRF terminal unit is connected to
  40546         \note central dedicated outdoor air through air terminal single duct mixer object.
  40547         \note When this VRF terminal is used as air loop equipment the autosized flow
  40548         \note rate will be set to 0 when an outdoor air system is connected to this air loop,
  40549         \note otherwise the outdoor air flow rate will equal the maximum outdoor air flow rate.
  40550   N6 ,  \field Heating Outdoor Air Flow Rate
  40551         \type real
  40552         \units m3/s
  40553         \minimum 0.0
  40554         \autosizable
  40555         \note This field is used only when an oudoor air mixer is included.
  40556         \note This field is set to zero flow when the VRF terminal unit is connected to
  40557         \note central dedicated outdoor air through air terminal single duct mixer object.
  40558         \note When this VRF terminal is used as air loop equipment the autosized flow
  40559         \note rate will be set to 0 when an outdoor air system is connected to this air loop,
  40560         \note otherwise the outdoor air flow rate will equal the maximum outdoor air flow rate.
  40561   N7 ,  \field No Load Outdoor Air Flow Rate
  40562         \type real
  40563         \units m3/s
  40564         \minimum 0.0
  40565         \autosizable
  40566         \note This field is used only when an oudoor air mixer is included.
  40567         \note This field is set to zero flow when the VRF terminal unit is connected to
  40568         \note central dedicated outdoor air through air terminal single duct mixer object.
  40569         \note When this VRF terminal is used as air loop equipment the autosized flow
  40570         \note rate will be set to 0 when an outdoor air system is connected to this air loop,
  40571         \note otherwise the outdoor air flow rate will equal the maximum outdoor air flow rate.
  40572   A5 ,  \field Supply Air Fan Operating Mode Schedule Name
  40573         \type object-list
  40574         \object-list ScheduleNames
  40575         \note Required for zone equipment. Leave blank if terminal unit is used in AirLoopHVAC:OutdoorAirSystem:EquipmentList.
  40576         \note Also leave blank if terminal unit is used on main AirloopHVAC branch and terminal unit has no fan.
  40577   A6 ,  \field Supply Air Fan Placement
  40578         \type choice
  40579         \key BlowThrough
  40580         \key DrawThrough
  40581         \default BlowThrough
  40582         \note Select fan placement as either blow through or draw through.
  40583         \note Required for zone equipment. This field is ignored if the VRF terminal unit is used
  40584         \note in AirLoopHVAC:OutdoorAirSystem:EquipmentList.
  40585         \note This field is also ignored if VRF terminal unit is used on main AirloopHVAC branch
  40586         \note and terminal unit has no fan.
  40587   A7 ,  \field Supply Air Fan Object Type
  40588         \type choice
  40589         \key Fan:SystemModel
  40590         \key Fan:OnOff
  40591         \key Fan:ConstantVolume
  40592         \key Fan:VariableVolume
  40593         \default Fan:ConstantVolume
  40594         \note Supply Air Fan Object Type must be Fan:SystemModel, Fan:OnOff, or Fan:ConstantVolume
  40595         \note if AirConditioner:VariableRefrigerantFlow is used to model VRF outdoor unit
  40596         \note Supply Air Fan Object Type must be Fan:SystemModel or Fan:VariableVolume if
  40597         \note AirConditioner:VariableRefrigerantFlow:FluidTemperatureControl or
  40598         \note AirConditioner:VariableRefrigerantFlow:FluidTemperatureControl:HR
  40599         \note is used to model VRF outdoor unit
  40600         \note Required for zone equipment. Leave blank if terminal unit is used in AirLoopHVAC:OutdoorAirSystem:EquipmentList.
  40601         \note Also leave blank if terminal unit is used on main AirloopHVAC branch and terminal unit has no fan.
  40602   A8 ,  \field Supply Air Fan Object Name
  40603         \type object-list
  40604         \object-list FansCVandOnOffandVAV
  40605         \object-list FansSystemModel
  40606   A9 ,  \field Outside Air Mixer Object Type
  40607         \type choice
  40608         \key OutdoorAir:Mixer
  40609         \note Currently only one type OutdoorAir:Mixer object is available.
  40610         \note If this field is blank, and outside air mixer is not used.
  40611         \note This field should be left blank if the VRF terminal unit is connected to
  40612         \note central dedicated outdoor air through an AirTerminal:SingleDuct:Mixer object.
  40613         \note This field may also be left blank when the VRF terminal is used in the air
  40614         \note loop or outdoor air system.
  40615   A10,  \field Outside Air Mixer Object Name
  40616         \type object-list
  40617         \object-list OutdoorAirMixers
  40618         \note If this field is blank, the OutdoorAir:Mixer is not used.
  40619         \note This optional field specifies the name of the OutdoorAir:Mixer object.
  40620         \note When used, this name needs to match name of the OutdoorAir:Mixer object.
  40621         \note This field should be left blank if the VRF terminal unit is connected to
  40622         \note central dedicated outdoor air through an AirTerminal:SingleDuct:Mixer object.
  40623         \note This field may also be left blank when the VRF terminal is used in the air
  40624         \note loop or outdoor air system.
  40625   A11,  \field Cooling Coil Object Type
  40626         \type choice
  40627         \key Coil:Cooling:DX:VariableRefrigerantFlow
  40628         \key Coil:Cooling:DX:VariableRefrigerantFlow:FluidTemperatureControl
  40629         \note Cooling Coil Type must be Coil:Cooling:DX:VariableRefrigerantFlow
  40630         \note if AirConditioner:VariableRefrigerantFlow is used
  40631         \note to model VRF outdoor unit
  40632         \note Cooling Coil Type must be
  40633         \note Coil:Cooling:DX:VariableRefrigerantFlow:FluidTemperatureControl
  40634         \note if AirConditioner:VariableRefrigerantFlow:FluidTemperatureControl or
  40635         \note if AirConditioner:VariableRefrigerantFlow:FluidTemperatureControl:HR
  40636         \note is used to model VRF outdoor unit
  40637         \note This field may be left blank if heating-only mode is used
  40638   A12,  \field Cooling Coil Object Name
  40639         \type object-list
  40640         \object-list CoolingCoilsDXVarRefrigFlow
  40641         \object-list CoolingCoilsDXVarRefrigFlowFluidTemperatureControl
  40642         \note Cooling Coil Type must be Coil:Cooling:DX:VariableRefrigerantFlow
  40643         \note This field may be left blank if heating-only mode is used
  40644   A13,  \field Heating Coil Object Type
  40645         \type choice
  40646         \key Coil:Heating:DX:VariableRefrigerantFlow
  40647         \key Coil:Heating:DX:VariableRefrigerantFlow:FluidTemperatureControl
  40648         \note Heating Coil Type must be Coil:Heating:DX:VariableRefrigerantFlow
  40649         \note if AirConditioner:VariableRefrigerantFlow is used
  40650         \note to model VRF outdoor unit
  40651         \note Heating Coil Type must be
  40652         \note Coil:Heating:DX:VariableRefrigerantFlow:FluidTemperatureControl
  40653         \note if AirConditioner:VariableRefrigerantFlow:FluidTemperatureControl or
  40654         \note if AirConditioner:VariableRefrigerantFlow:FluidTemperatureControl:HR
  40655         \note is used to model VRF outdoor unit
  40656         \note This field may be left blank if cooling-only mode is used
  40657   A14,  \field Heating Coil Object Name
  40658         \type object-list
  40659         \object-list HeatingCoilsDXVarRefrigFlow
  40660         \object-list HeatingCoilsDXVarRefrigFlowFluidTemperatureControl
  40661         \note Heating Coil Type must be Coil:Heating:DX:VariableRefrigerantFlow
  40662         \note This field may be left blank if cooling-only mode is used
  40663   N8 ,  \field Zone Terminal Unit On Parasitic Electric Energy Use
  40664         \type real
  40665         \units W
  40666         \minimum 0
  40667         \default 0
  40668   N9 ,  \field Zone Terminal Unit Off Parasitic Electric Energy Use
  40669         \type real
  40670         \units W
  40671         \minimum 0
  40672         \default 0
  40673   N10, \field Rated Heating Capacity Sizing Ratio
  40674        \type real
  40675        \units W/W
  40676        \minimum 1.0
  40677        \default 1.0
  40678        \note If this terminal unit's heating coil is autosized, the heating capacity is sized
  40679        \note to be equal to the cooling capacity multiplied by this sizing ratio.
  40680        \note This input applies to the terminal unit heating coil and overrides the sizing
  40681        \note ratio entered in the AirConditioner:VariableRefrigerantFlow object.
  40682   A15, \field Availability Manager List Name
  40683        \note Enter the name of an AvailabilityManagerAssignmentList object.
  40684        \type object-list
  40685        \object-list SystemAvailabilityManagerLists
  40686   A16, \field Design Specification ZoneHVAC Sizing Object Name
  40687        \note Enter the name of a DesignSpecificationZoneHVACSizing object.
  40688        \type object-list
  40689        \object-list DesignSpecificationZoneHVACSizingName
  40690   A17, \field Supplemental Heating Coil Object Type
  40691        \type choice
  40692        \key Coil:Heating:Fuel
  40693        \key Coil:Heating:Electric
  40694        \key Coil:Heating:Water
  40695        \key Coil:Heating:Steam
  40696        \note works with gas, electric, hot water and steam heating coil.
  40697   A18, \field Supplemental Heating Coil Name
  40698        \type object-list
  40699        \object-list HeatingCoilName
  40700        \note Needs to match in the supplemental heating coil object.
  40701   N11, \field Maximum Supply Air Temperature from Supplemental Heater
  40702        \required-field
  40703        \type real
  40704        \units C
  40705        \autosizable
  40706        \default autosize
  40707        \note Supply air temperature from the supplemental heater will not exceed this value.
  40708   N12, \field Maximum Outdoor Dry-Bulb Temperature for Supplemental Heater Operation
  40709        \type real
  40710        \maximum 21.0
  40711        \default 21.0
  40712        \units C
  40713        \note Supplemental heater will not operate when outdoor temperature exceeds this value.
  40714   A19; \field Controlling Zone or Thermostat Location
  40715        \type object-list
  40716        \object-list ZoneNames
  40717        \note Used only for AirloopHVAC equipment on a main branch and defines zone name where thermostat is located.
  40718        \note Not required for zone equipment. Leave blank if terminal unit is used in AirLoopHVAC:OutdoorAirSystem:EquipmentList.
  40719        \note Required when terminal unit is used on main AirloopHVAC branch and coils are not set point controlled.
  40720        \note When terminal unit is used in air loop and is load controlled, this zone's thermostat will control operation.
  40721 
