  41521 
  41522 ZoneHVAC:Baseboard:RadiantConvective:Steam,
  41523        \min-fields 11
  41524        \extensible:2 - repeat last two fields, remembering to remove ; from "inner" fields.
  41525        \memo The number of surfaces can be expanded beyond 100, if necessary, by adding more
  41526        \memo groups to the end of the list
  41527   A1,  \field Name
  41528        \required-field
  41529        \reference-class-name validBranchEquipmentTypes
  41530        \reference validBranchEquipmentNames
  41531        \reference ZoneEquipmentNames
  41532   A2,  \field Availability Schedule Name
  41533        \note Availability schedule name for this system. Schedule value > 0 means the system is available.
  41534        \note If this field is blank, the system is always available.
  41535        \type object-list
  41536        \object-list ScheduleNames
  41537   A3,  \field Inlet Node Name
  41538        \required-field
  41539        \type node
  41540   A4,  \field Outlet Node Name
  41541        \required-field
  41542        \type node
  41543   A5 , \field Heating Design Capacity Method
  41544        \type choice
  41545        \key HeatingDesignCapacity
  41546        \key CapacityPerFloorArea
  41547        \key FractionOfAutosizedHeatingCapacity
  41548        \default HeatingDesignCapacity
  41549        \note Enter the method used to determine the heating design capacity.
  41550        \note HeatingDesignCapacity = > selected when the design heating capacity value or autosize
  41551        \note is specified. CapacityPerFloorArea = > selected when the design heating capacity is
  41552        \note determine from user specified heating capacity per floor area and zone floor area.
  41553        \note FractionOfAutosizedHeatingCapacity = > is selected when the design heating capacity is
  41554        \note determined from a user specified fraction and the auto-sized design heating capacity.
  41555   N1 , \field Heating Design Capacity
  41556        \type real
  41557        \units W
  41558        \minimum 0.0
  41559        \autosizable
  41560        \ip-units W
  41561        \default autosize
  41562        \note Enter the design heating capacity.Required field when the heating design capacity method
  41563        \note HeatingDesignCapacity.
  41564   N2 , \field Heating Design Capacity Per Floor Area
  41565        \type real
  41566        \units W/m2
  41567        \minimum 0.0
  41568        \note Enter the heating design capacity per zone floor area.Required field when the heating design
  41569        \note capacity method field is CapacityPerFloorArea.
  41570   N3 , \field Fraction of Autosized Heating Design Capacity
  41571        \type real
  41572        \minimum 0.0
  41573        \default 1.0
  41574        \note Enter the fraction of auto - sized heating design capacity.Required field when capacity the
  41575        \note heating design capacity method field is FractionOfAutosizedHeatingCapacity.
  41576   N4,  \field Degree of SubCooling
  41577        \type real
  41578        \minimum 1.0
  41579        \default 5.0
  41580        \units deltaC
  41581   N5,  \field Maximum Steam Flow Rate
  41582        \required-field
  41583        \type real
  41584        \autosizable
  41585        \minimum> 0.0
  41586        \units m3/s
  41587   N6,  \field Convergence Tolerance
  41588        \type real
  41589        \minimum> 0.0
  41590        \default 0.001
