  42302 
  42303 ZoneHVAC:Baseboard:RadiantConvective:Electric,
  42304        \min-fields 8
  42305        \extensible:2 - repeat last two fields, remembering to remove ; from "inner" fields.
  42306        \memo The number of surfaces can be expanded beyond 100, if necessary, by adding more
  42307        \memo groups to the end of the list
  42308   A1 , \field Name
  42309        \required-field
  42310        \reference ZoneEquipmentNames
  42311   A2 , \field Availability Schedule Name
  42312        \note Availability schedule name for this system. Schedule value > 0 means the system is available.
  42313        \note If this field is blank, the system is always available.
  42314        \type object-list
  42315        \object-list ScheduleNames
  42316   A3 , \field Heating Design Capacity Method
  42317        \type choice
  42318        \key HeatingDesignCapacity
  42319        \key CapacityPerFloorArea
  42320        \key FractionOfAutosizedHeatingCapacity
  42321        \default HeatingDesignCapacity
  42322        \note Enter the method used to determine the heating design capacity.
  42323        \note HeatingDesignCapacity = > selected when the design heating capacity value or autosize
  42324        \note is specified. CapacityPerFloorArea = > selected when the design heating capacity is
  42325        \note determine from user specified heating capacity per floor area and zone floor area.
  42326        \note FractionOfAutosizedHeatingCapacity = > is selected when the design heating capacity is
  42327        \note determined from a user specified fraction and the auto-sized design heating capacity.
  42328   N1 , \field Heating Design Capacity
  42329        \type real
  42330        \units W
  42331        \minimum 0.0
  42332        \autosizable
  42333        \ip-units W
  42334        \default autosize
  42335        \note Enter the design heating capacity.Required field when the heating design capacity method
  42336        \note HeatingDesignCapacity.
  42337   N2 , \field Heating Design Capacity Per Floor Area
  42338        \type real
  42339        \units W/m2
  42340        \minimum 0.0
  42341        \note Enter the heating design capacity per zone floor area.Required field when the heating design
  42342        \note capacity method field is CapacityPerFloorArea.
  42343   N3 , \field Fraction of Autosized Heating Design Capacity
  42344        \type real
  42345        \minimum 0.0
  42346        \default 1.0
  42347        \note Enter the fraction of auto - sized heating design capacity.Required field when capacity the
  42348        \note heating design capacity method field is FractionOfAutosizedHeatingCapacity.
  42349   N4 , \field Efficiency
  42350        \maximum 1.0
  42351        \minimum> 0.0
  42352        \default 1.0
