  43098   A5 , \field Cooling Design Capacity Method
  43099        \type choice
  43100        \key None
  43101        \key CoolingDesignCapacity
  43102        \key CapacityPerFloorArea
  43103        \key FractionOfAutosizedCoolingCapacity
  43104        \default CoolingDesignCapacity
  43105        \note Enter the method used to determine the cooling design capacity for scalable sizing.
  43106        \note CoolingDesignCapacity => selected when the design cooling capacity value is specified or
  43107        \note auto-sized. CapacityPerFloorArea => selected when the design cooling capacity is determined
  43108        \note from user specified cooling capacity per floor area and total floor area of cooled zone
  43109        \note served by the hydrolic unit. FractionOfAutosizedCoolingCapacity => is selected when the
  43110        \note design cooling capacity is determined from a user specified fraction and the auto-sized
  43111        \note design cooling capacity of the system.
  43112   N4 , \field Cooling Design Capacity
  43113        \type real
  43114        \units W
  43115        \minimum 0.0
  43116        \autosizable
  43117        \note Enter the design cooling capacity. Required field when the cooling design capacity method
  43118        \note CoolingDesignCapacity.
  43119   N5 , \field Cooling Design Capacity Per Floor Area
  43120        \type real
  43121        \units W/m2
  43122        \minimum 0.0
  43123        \note Enter the cooling design capacity per total floor area of cooled zones served by the unit.
  43124        \note Required field when the cooling design capacity method field is CapacityPerFloorArea.
  43125   N6, \field Fraction of Autosized Cooling Design Capacity
  43126        \type real
  43127        \minimum 0.0
  43128        \note Enter the fraction of auto-sized cooling design capacity. Required field when the cooling
  43129        \note design capacity method field is FractionOfAutosizedCoolingCapacity.
