  44110         \units deltaC
  44111         \minimum 0
  44112         \default 0.5
  44113    A11, \field Heating Control Temperature Schedule Name
  44114         \type object-list
  44115         \object-list ScheduleNames
  44116    A12, \field Cooling Design Capacity Method
  44117         \type choice
  44118         \key None
  44119         \key CoolingDesignCapacity
  44120         \key CapacityPerFloorArea
  44121         \key FractionOfAutosizedCoolingCapacity
  44122         \default CoolingDesignCapacity
  44123         \note Enter the method used to determine the cooling design capacity for scalable sizing.
  44124         \note CoolingDesignCapacity => selected when the design cooling capacity value is specified or
  44125         \note auto-sized. CapacityPerFloorArea => selected when the design cooling capacity is determined
  44126         \note from user specified cooling capacity per floor area and total floor area of cooled zone
  44127         \note served by the hydrolic unit. FractionOfAutosizedCoolingCapacity => is selected when the
  44128         \note design cooling capacity is determined from a user specified fraction and the auto-sized
  44129         \note design cooling capacity of the system.
  44130    N10, \field Cooling Design Capacity
  44131         \type real
  44132         \units W
  44133         \minimum 0.0
  44134         \autosizable
  44135         \note Enter the design cooling capacity. Required field when the cooling design capacity method
  44136         \note CoolingDesignCapacity.
  44137    N11, \field Cooling Design Capacity Per Floor Area
  44138         \type real
  44139         \units W/m2
  44140         \minimum 0.0
  44141         \note Enter the cooling design capacity per total floor area of cooled zones served by the unit.
  44142         \note Required field when the cooling design capacity method field is CapacityPerFloorArea.
  44143    N12, \field Fraction of Autosized Cooling Design Capacity
  44144         \type real
  44145         \minimum 0.0
  44146         \note Enter the fraction of auto-sized cooling design capacity. Required field when the cooling
  44147         \note design capacity method field is FractionOfAutosizedCoolingCapacity.
  44148    N13, \field Maximum Cold Water Flow
  44149         \units m3/s
  44150         \minimum 0
  44151         \autosizable
  44152         \ip-units gal/min
