  46963        \minimum> 0.0
  46964        \default 600.0
  46965   N7 , \field Beam Rated Cooling Room Air Chilled Water Temperature Difference
  46966        \note Difference in temperature between the zone air and the entering chilled water at the rating point.
  46967        \type real
  46968        \units deltaC
  46969        \minimum> 0.0
  46970        \default 10.0
  46971   N8 , \field Beam Rated Chilled Water Volume Flow Rate per Beam Length
  46972        \note The volume flow rate of chilled water per meter of beam length at the rating point.
  46973        \type real
  46974        \units m3/s-m
  46975        \ip-units gal/min-ft
  46976        \minimum> 0.0
  46977        \default 0.00005
  46978   A11, \field Beam Cooling Capacity Temperature Difference Modification Factor Curve Name
  46979        \note Adjusts beam cooling capacity when the temperature difference between entering water and zone air
  46980        \note is different than at the rating point.  Single independent variable is the ratio of the current
  46981        \note temperature difference divided by the rating point temperature difference.
  46982        \note This field is required when beam is connected to a chilled water plant.
  46983        \type object-list
  46984        \object-list UnivariateFunctions
  46985   A12, \field Beam Cooling Capacity Air Flow Modification Factor Curve Name
  46986        \note Adjusts beam cooling capacity when the primary air supply flow rate is different
  46987        \note than at the rating point. The single independent variable is the current normalized
  46988        \note air flow rate divided by the normalized air flow rate at the rating point.
  46989        \note This field is required when beam is connected to a chilled water plant.
  46990        \type object-list
  46991        \object-list UnivariateFunctions
  46992   A13, \field Beam Cooling Capacity Chilled Water Flow Modification Factor Curve Name
  46993        \note Adjusts beam cooling capacity when the normalized chilled water flow rate is different
  46994        \note than at the rating point. The single independent variable is the current normalized
  46995        \note chilled water flow rate divided by the normalized chilled water flow rate at the rating point.
  46996        \note This field is required when beam is connected to a chilled water plant.
  46997        \type object-list
  46998        \object-list UnivariateFunctions
  46999   N9 , \field Beam Rated Heating Capacity per Beam Length
  47000        \note Sensible heating capacity per meter of beam length at the rating point.
  47001        \type real
  47002        \units W/m
  47003        \minimum> 0.0
  47004        \default 1500.0
  47005   N10, \field Beam Rated Heating Room Air Hot Water Temperature Difference
  47006        \note Difference in temperature between the zone air and the entering hot water at the rating point.
  47007        \type real
  47008        \units deltaC
  47009        \minimum> 0.0
  47010        \default 27.8
  47011   N11, \field Beam Rated Hot Water Volume Flow Rate per Beam Length
  47012        \note The volume flow rate of hoy water per meter of beam length at the rating point.
  47013        \type real
  47014        \units m3/s-m
  47015        \ip-units gal/min-ft
  47016        \minimum> 0.0
  47017        \default 0.00005
  47018   A14, \field Beam Heating Capacity Temperature Difference Modification Factor Curve Name
  47019        \note Adjusts beam heating capacity when the temperature difference between entering water and zone air
  47020        \note is different than at the rating point.  Single independent variable is the ratio of the current
  47021        \note temperature difference divided by the rating point temperature difference.
  47022        \note This field is required when beam is connected to a hot water plant.
  47023        \type object-list
  47024        \object-list UnivariateFunctions
  47025   A15, \field Beam Heating Capacity Air Flow Modification Factor Curve Name
  47026        \note Adjusts beam heating capacity when the primary air supply flow rate is different
  47027        \note than at the rating point. The single independent variable is the current normalized
  47028        \note air flow rate divided by the normalized air flow rate at the rating point.
  47029        \note This field is required when beam is connected to a hot water plant.
  47030        \type object-list
  47031        \object-list UnivariateFunctions
  47032   A16; \field Beam Heating Capacity Hot Water Flow Modification Factor Curve Name
  47033        \note Adjusts beam heating capacity when the normalized hot water flow rate is different
  47034        \note than at the rating point. The single independent variable is the current normalized
  47035        \note hot water flow rate divided by the normalized hot water flow rate at the rating point.
  47036        \note This field is required when beam is connected to a hot water plant.
  47037        \type object-list
  47038        \object-list UnivariateFunctions
