  47402 \group Zone HVAC Equipment Connections
  47403 
  47404 !*****************ZONE EQUIPMENT SPECIFICATION*********************
  47405 !Zone Heating and Cooling Equipment are attached to zones by the following statements:
  47406 
  47407 ZoneHVAC:EquipmentList,
  47408        \extensible:6 Duplicate the six fields Zone Equipment Object Type through Sequential Heating Fraction
  47409        \memo List equipment in simulation order.  Note that an ZoneHVAC:AirDistributionUnit
  47410        \memo object must be listed in this statement if there is a forced
  47411        \memo air system serving the zone from the air loop.
  47412        \memo Equipment is simulated in the order specified by Zone Equipment Cooling Sequence and
  47413        \memo Zone Equipment Heating or No-Load Sequence, depending on the thermostat request.
  47414        \memo For equipment of similar type, assign sequence 1 to the first system intended to
  47415        \memo serve that type of load.  For situations where one or more equipment types has limited capacity or
  47416        \memo limited control, order the sequence so that the most controllable piece of equipment runs last.
  47417        \memo For example, with a dedicated outdoor air system (DOAS), the air terminal for the DOAS
  47418        \memo should be assigned Heating Sequence = 1 and Cooling Sequence = 1.  Any other equipment should
  47419        \memo be assigned sequence 2 or higher so that it will see the net load after the DOAS air is added
  47420        \memo to the zone.
  47421        \min-fields 8
  47422   A1 , \field Name
  47423        \required-field
  47424        \reference ZoneEquipmentLists
  47425   A2 , \field Load Distribution Scheme
  47426        \type choice
  47427        \key SequentialLoad
  47428        \key UniformLoad
  47429        \key UniformPLR
  47430        \key SequentialUniformPLR
  47431        \default SequentialLoad
  47432   A3 , \field Zone Equipment 1 Object Type
  47433        \begin-extensible
  47434        \type choice
  47435        \key ZoneHVAC:TerminalUnit:VariableRefrigerantFlow
  47436        \key ZoneHVAC:AirDistributionUnit
  47437        \key ZoneHVAC:EnergyRecoveryVentilator
  47438        \key ZoneHVAC:EvaporativeCoolerUnit
  47439        \key ZoneHVAC:HybridUnitaryHVAC
  47440        \key ZoneHVAC:ForcedAir:UserDefined
  47441        \key ZoneHVAC:FourPipeFanCoil
  47442        \key ZoneHVAC:OutdoorAirUnit
  47443        \key ZoneHVAC:PackagedTerminalAirConditioner
  47444        \key ZoneHVAC:PackagedTerminalHeatPump
  47445        \key ZoneHVAC:UnitHeater
  47446        \key ZoneHVAC:UnitVentilator
  47447        \key ZoneHVAC:VentilatedSlab
  47448        \key ZoneHVAC:WaterToAirHeatPump
  47449        \key ZoneHVAC:WindowAirConditioner
  47450        \key ZoneHVAC:Baseboard:RadiantConvective:Electric
  47451        \key ZoneHVAC:Baseboard:RadiantConvective:Water
  47452        \key ZoneHVAC:Baseboard:RadiantConvective:Steam
  47453        \key ZoneHVAC:CoolingPanel:RadiantConvective:Water
  47454        \key ZoneHVAC:Baseboard:Convective:Electric
  47455        \key ZoneHVAC:Baseboard:Convective:Water
  47456        \key ZoneHVAC:HighTemperatureRadiant
  47457        \key ZoneHVAC:LowTemperatureRadiant:VariableFlow
  47458        \key ZoneHVAC:LowTemperatureRadiant:ConstantFlow
  47459        \key ZoneHVAC:LowTemperatureRadiant:Electric
  47460        \key ZoneHVAC:Dehumidifier:DX
  47461        \key ZoneHVAC:IdealLoadsAirSystem
  47462        \key ZoneHVAC:RefrigerationChillerSet
  47463        \key Fan:ZoneExhaust
  47464        \key WaterHeater:HeatPump:PumpedCondenser
  47465        \key WaterHeater:HeatPump:WrappedCondenser
  47466        \key HeatExchanger:AirToAir:FlatPlate
  47467        \key AirLoopHVAC:UnitarySystem
  47468        \required-field
  47469   A4 , \field Zone Equipment 1 Name
  47470        \required-field
  47471        \type object-list
  47472        \object-list ZoneEquipmentNames
  47473   N1 , \field Zone Equipment 1 Cooling Sequence
  47474        \required-field
  47475        \type integer
  47476        \minimum 0
  47477        \note Specifies the zone equipment simulation order
