  48482 ZoneHVAC:EquipmentConnections,
  48483        \memo Specifies the HVAC equipment connections for a zone. Node names are specified for the
  48484        \memo zone air node, air inlet nodes, air exhaust nodes, and the air return node. A zone
  48485        \memo equipment list is referenced which lists all HVAC equipment connected to the zone.
  48486   A1 , \field Zone Name
  48487        \required-field
  48488        \type object-list
  48489        \object-list ZoneNames
  48490   A2 , \field Zone Conditioning Equipment List Name
  48491        \note Enter the name of a ZoneHVAC:EquipmentList object.
  48492        \required-field
  48493        \type object-list
  48494        \object-list ZoneEquipmentLists
  48495   A3 , \field Zone Air Inlet Node or NodeList Name
  48496        \type node
  48497   A4 , \field Zone Air Exhaust Node or NodeList Name
  48498        \type node
  48499   A5 , \field Zone Air Node Name
  48500        \required-field
  48501        \type node
  48502   A6 , \field Zone Return Air Node or NodeList Name
  48503        \type node
  48504   A7 , \field Zone Return Air Node 1 Flow Rate Fraction Schedule Name
  48505        \note This schedule is multiplied times the base return air flow rate.
  48506        \note If this field is left blank, the schedule defaults to 1.0 at all times.
  48507        \type object-list
  48508        \object-list ScheduleNames
  48509   A8 ; \field Zone Return Air Node 1 Flow Rate Basis Node or NodeList Name
  48510        \note The optional basis node(s) used to calculate the base return air flow
  48511        \note rate for the first return air node in this zone. The return air flow rate is the sum of the flow rates
  48512        \note at the basis node(s) multiplied by the Zone Return Air Flow Rate Fraction Schedule.
  48513        \note If this  field is blank, then the base return air flow rate is the total supply
  48514        \note inlet flow rate to the zone less the total exhaust node flow rate from the zone.
  48515        \type node
  48516 
