  50304 
  50305 Coil:Cooling:DX:MultiSpeed,
  50306        \memo Direct expansion (DX) cooling coil and condensing unit (includes electric or
  50307        \memo engine-driven compressor and condenser fan), multi-speed (or variable-speed).
  50308        \memo Optional moisture evaporation from wet coil when compressor cycles off with continuous
  50309        \memo fan operation. Requires two to four sets of performance data and will interpolate
  50310        \memo between speeds. Modeled as a single coil (multi-speed compressor or multiple
  50311        \memo compressors with row split or intertwined coil).
