  50499        \maximum 3000.0
  50500        \default 0.0
  50501        \note The nominal time for condensate to begin leaving the coil's condensate
  50502        \note drain line at the coil's rated air flow rate and temperature conditions.
  50503        \note Nominal time is equal to the ratio of the energy of the coil's maximum
  50504        \note condensate holding capacity (J) to the coil's steady state latent capacity (W).
