  50999   A37; \field Zone Name for Condenser Placement
  51000        \type object-list
  51001        \object-list ZoneNames
  51002        \note This input field is name of a conditioned or unconditioned zone where the secondary
  51003        \note coil (condenser) of DX system or a heat pump is to be placed.  This is an optional
  51004        \note input field specified only when user desires to reject the condenser heat into a
  51005        \note zone. The heat rejected is modelled as internal sensible heat gain of the zone.
  51006 
  51007 Coil:Cooling:DX:VariableSpeed,
  51008         \memo Direct expansion (DX) cooling coil and condensing unit (includes electric compressor
  51009         \memo and condenser fan), variable-speed. Optional inputs for moisture evaporation from
  51010         \memo wet coil when compressor cycles off with continuous fan operation. Requires two to
  51011         \memo ten sets of performance data and will interpolate between speeds. Modeled as a
  51012         \memo single coil with variable-speed compressor.
  51013         \min-fields 31
