  51652 Coil:Cooling:DX:TwoStageWithHumidityControlMode,
  51653         \memo Direct expansion (DX) cooling coil and condensing unit (includes electric compressor
  51654         \memo and condenser fan), two-stage with humidity control mode (e.g. sub-cool or hot gas
  51655         \memo reheat). Optional inputs for moisture evaporation from wet coil when compressor
  51656         \memo cycles off with continuous fan operation. Requires two to four sets of performance
  51657         \memo data, see CoilPerformance:DX:Cooling. Stages are modeled as a face-split coil.
  51658   \min-fields 10
  51659   A1 , \field Name
  51660        \required-field
  51661        \type alpha
  51662        \reference CoolingCoilsDX
  51663        \reference CoolingCoilsDXMultiModeOrSingleSpeed
  51664        \reference DesuperHeatingCoilSources
  51665        \reference AFNCoilNames
  51666   A2 , \field Availability Schedule Name
  51667        \note Availability schedule name for this system. Schedule value > 0 means the system is available.
  51668        \note If this field is blank, the system is always available.
  51669        \type object-list
  51670        \object-list ScheduleNames
  51671   A3 , \field Air Inlet Node Name
  51672        \required-field
  51673        \type node
  51674   A4 , \field Air Outlet Node Name
  51675        \required-field
  51676        \type node
