  52732        \type real
  52733        \units C
  52734        \note The outdoor temperature when the compressor is automatically turned back on following an
  52735        \note automatic shut off because of low outdoor dry-bulb temperature. This field is only used
  52736        \note for the calculation of HSPF. If this field is not provided, then outdoor bin temperature
  52737        \note used in the HSPF calculation is always considered to be greater than this temperature and
  52738        \note 'Minimum Outdoor Dry-Bulb Temperature for Compressor Operation' field described above.
