  53365        \note db = entering dry-bulb temperature seen by the primary DX coil (C)
  53366        \note This input field is name of sensible heat ratio modifier biquadratic curve.  The value
  53367        \note of this curve modifies the nominal sensible heat ratio for current time step depending
  53368        \note on the secondary zone air node wet-bulb temperature and the heating DX coil entering
  53369        \note air dry-bulb temperature.  This is an optional input field.  If this input field is left
  53370        \note blank, then the nominal sensible heat ratio specified in the field above will be used.
