  54011 
  54012 Coil:Cooling:WaterToAirHeatPump:ParameterEstimation,
  54013         \memo Direct expansion (DX) cooling coil for water-to-air heat pump (includes electric
  54014         \memo compressor), single-speed, parameter estimation model. Optional inputs for moisture
  54015         \memo evaporation from wet coil when compressor cycles off with continuous fan operation.
  54016         \memo Parameter estimation model is a deterministic model that requires a consistent set of
  54017         \memo parameters to describe the operating conditions of the heat pump components.
  54018         \min-fields 18
  54019    A1 , \field Name
  54020         \required-field
  54021         \type alpha
  54022         \reference CoolingCoilsWaterToAirHP
  54023         \reference-class-name validBranchEquipmentTypes
  54024         \reference validBranchEquipmentNames
  54025    A2 , \field Compressor Type
  54026         \required-field
  54027         \type choice
  54028         \key Reciprocating
  54029         \key Rotary
  54030         \key Scroll
  54031         \note Parameters 1-5 are as named below.
  54032         \note Parameters 6-10 depend on the type of compressor and fluid.
  54033         \note Refer to the InputOutputReference on the parameters required
  54034    A3,  \field Refrigerant Type
  54035         \type object-list
  54036         \object-list FluidNames
  54037         \default R22
  54038    N1,  \field Design Source Side Flow Rate
  54039         \required-field
  54040         \type real
  54041         \minimum> 0.0
