  54456 Coil:Cooling:WaterToAirHeatPump:VariableSpeedEquationFit,
  54457         \memo Direct expansion (DX) cooling coil for water-to-air heat pump (includes electric
  54458         \memo compressor), variable-speed, equation-fit model. Optional inputs for moisture
  54459         \memo evaporation from wet coil when compressor cycles off with continuous fan operation.
  54460         \memo Equation-fit model uses normalized curves to describe the heat pump performance.
  54461         \memo Requires two to ten sets of performance data and will interpolate between speeds.
  54462         \memo Modeled as a single coil with variable-speed compressor.
  54463         \min-fields 27
  54464    A1,  \field Name
  54465         \required-field
  54466         \type alpha
  54467         \reference CoolingCoilsWaterToAirVSHP
  54468         \reference-class-name validBranchEquipmentTypes
  54469         \reference validBranchEquipmentNames
