  55371 Coil:Heating:WaterToAirHeatPump:VariableSpeedEquationFit,
  55372         \memo Direct expansion (DX) heating coil for water-to-air heat pump (includes electric
  55373         \memo compressor), variable-speed, equation-fit model. Equation-fit model uses normalized
  55374         \memo curves to describe the heat pump performance. Requires two to ten sets of performance
  55375         \memo data and will interpolate between speeds.
