  57468        \note curve = a + b*wb + c*wb**2 + d*ewt + e*ewt**2 + f*wb*ewt
  57469        \note wb = entering wet-bulb temperature or dry bulb temperature upon selection (C)
  57470        \note ewt = water entering temperature seen by the condenser (C)
