  57766 CoilSystem:Cooling:Water:HeatExchangerAssisted,
  57767        \memo Virtual component consisting of a chilled-water cooling coil and an air-to-air heat
  57768        \memo exchanger. The air-to-air heat exchanger precools the air entering the cooling coil
  57769        \memo and reuses this energy to reheat the supply air leaving the cooling coil. This heat
  57770        \memo exchange process improves the latent removal performance of the cooling coil (lower
  57771        \memo sensible heat ratio).
  57772        \min-fields 5
