  59468 Dehumidifier:Desiccant:System,
  59469       \memo This compound object models a desiccant heat exchanger, an optional
  59470       \memo heater, and associated fans. The process air stream is the air which
  59471       \memo is dehumidified. The regeneration air stream is the air which is
  59472       \memo heated to regenerate the desiccant. The desiccant heat exchanger
  59473       \memo transfers both sensible and latent energy between the process and
  59474       \memo regeneration air streams. The desiccant dehumidifier is typically used
  59475       \memo in an AirLoopHVAC:OutdoorAirSystem, but can also be specified in any AirLoopHVAC.
  59476       \min-fields 8
