  59787 HeatExchanger:Desiccant:BalancedFlow,
  59788       \memo This object models a balanced desiccant heat exchanger.
  59789       \memo The heat exchanger transfers both sensible and latent energy between the
  59790       \memo process and regeneration air streams. The air flow rate and face velocity
  59791       \memo are assumed to be the same on both the process and regeneration sides of the
  59792       \memo heat exchanger.
