  62510 AirConditioner:VariableRefrigerantFlow:FluidTemperatureControl,
  62511        \memo This is a key object in the new physics based VRF model applicable for Fluid
  62512        \memo Temperature Control
  62513        \memo It describes the Variable Refrigerant Flow system excluding the performance of indoor units
  62514        \memo Indoor units are modeled separately, see ZoneHVAC:TerminalUnit:VariableRefrigerantFlow
  62515        \extensible:3 - repeat last three fields, remembering to remove ; from "inner" fields.
  62516        \min-fields 41
  62517   A1 , \field Heat Pump Name
  62518        \required-field
  62519        \type alpha
  62520        \note Enter a unique name for this variable refrigerant flow heat pump
  62521   A2 , \field Availability Schedule Name
  62522        \type object-list
  62523        \object-list ScheduleNames
  62524        \note Enter the name of a schedule that defines the availability of the unit
  62525        \note Schedule values of 0 denote the unit is off. All other values denote the unit is available
  62526        \note If this field is left blank, the unit is available the entire simulation
  62527   A3 , \field Zone Terminal Unit List Name
  62528        \required-field
  62529        \type object-list
  62530        \object-list ZoneTerminalUnitListNames
  62531        \note Enter the name of a ZoneTerminalUnitList. This list connects zone terminal units to this
  62532        \note heat pump
  62533   A4 , \field Refrigerant Type
  62534        \type object-list
  62535        \object-list FluidNames
  62536        \default R410A
  62537   N1 , \field Rated Evaporative Capacity
  62538        \type real
  62539        \units W
  62540        \autosizable
  62541        \minimum> 0.0
  62542        \default 40000
  62543        \note Enter the total evaporative capacity in watts at rated conditions
  62544        \note This is the capacity corresponding to the max compressor speed at rated conditions
  62545        \note The actual evaporative capacity is obtained by multiplying the
  62546        \note rated capacity with the modification factor calculated by Evaporative
  62547        \note Capacity Multiplier Function of Temperature Curve
  62548   N2 , \field Rated Compressor Power Per Unit of Rated Evaporative Capacity
  62549        \type real
  62550        \units dimensionless
  62551        \minimum> 0.0
  62552        \default 0.35
  62553        \note Enter the rated compressor power per Watt of rated evaporative capacity [W/W]
  62554        \note Rated compressor power corresponds to the max compressor speed at rated conditions
  62555        \note The actual compressor power is obtained by multiplying the
  62556        \note rated power with the modification factor calculated by Compressor
  62557        \note Power Multiplier Function of Temperature Curve
  62558   N3 , \field Minimum Outdoor Air Temperature in Cooling Mode
  62559        \type real
  62560        \units C
  62561        \default -6.0
  62562        \note Enter the minimum outdoor temperature allowed for cooling operation
  62563        \note Cooling is disabled below this temperature
  62564   N4 , \field Maximum Outdoor Air Temperature in Cooling Mode
  62565        \type real
  62566        \units C
  62567        \default 43.0
  62568        \note Enter the maximum outdoor temperature allowed for cooling operation
  62569        \note Cooling is disabled above this temperature
