  63178        \note approaches the steady-state value according to the inputs for
  63179        \note Heat Recovery Cooling Energy Modifier and Heat Recovery
  63180        \note Cooling Energy Time Constant
  63181   N40, \field Heat Recovery Cooling Energy Time Constant
  63182        \type real
