  63185        \note This is used to describe the transition from Cooling Only mode to Heat Recovery mode
  63186        \note Enter the time constant used to model the transition
  63187        \note from cooling only mode to heat recovery mode
  63188   N41, \field Initial Heat Recovery Heating Capacity Fraction
  63189        \type real
  63190        \units W/W
