  63441 \group Controllers
  63442 !*****************Controller****************************
  63443 ! A Controller mimics the function of an actual physical controller, though it
  63444 ! is somewhat more limited.  It can sense one node variable, compare it with
  63445 ! its setpoint, and determine the desired value for another node variable.
  63446 !
  63447 ! Rule: A Controller can not span a loop manager boundary (but a Setpoint
  63448 ! Manager can). Thus in an air loop the sensed node and the controlled
  63449 ! device must be in the air loop.  This means that a single zone system can
  63450 ! not be modeled with a simple controller sensing zone temperature and
  63451 ! controlling coil water flow.  Instead this must be modeled as a Setpoint
  63452 ! Manager sensing a zone temperature and resetting the supply air temperature
  63453 ! setpoint each timestep.  This is artificial but should simplify the control
  63454 ! modeling task.
  63455 !
  63456 !
  63457 Controller:WaterCoil,
  63458        \memo Controller for a water coil which is located directly in an air loop branch or
  63459        \memo outdoor air equipment list. Controls the coil water flow to meet the specified
  63460        \memo leaving air setpoint(s). Used with Coil:Heating:Water, Coil:Cooling:Water,
  63461        \memo Coil:Cooling:Water:DetailedGeometry, and
  63462        \memo CoilSystem:Cooling:Water:HeatexchangerAssisted.
  63463   \min-fields 9
  63464   A1 , \field Name
  63465        \type alpha
  63466        \required-field
  63467        \reference AirLoopControllers
  63468        \reference WaterCoilControllers
  63469   A2 , \field Control Variable
  63470        \required-field
  63471        \type choice
  63472        \key Temperature
  63473        \key HumidityRatio
  63474        \key TemperatureAndHumidityRatio
  63475        \note keys HumidityRatio or TemperatureAndHumidityRatio
  63476        \note requires a ZoneControl:Humidistat object along
  63477        \note with SetpointManager:SingleZone:Humidity:Maximum,
  63478        \note SetpointManager:MultiZone:MaximumHumidity:Average, or
  63479        \note SetpointManager:Multizone:Humidity:Maximum object
  63480   A3 , \field Action
  63481        \type choice
  63482        \key Normal
  63483        \key Reverse
  63484        \note Leave blank to have this automatically selected from coil type.
  63485        \note Chilled water coils should be reverse action
  63486        \note Hot water coils should be normal action
  63487   A4 , \field Actuator Variable
  63488        \required-field
  63489        \type choice
  63490        \key Flow
  63491   A5 , \field Sensor Node Name
  63492        \required-field
  63493        \type node
  63494   A6 , \field Actuator Node Name
  63495        \required-field
  63496        \type node
  63497   N1 , \field Controller Convergence Tolerance
  63498        \units deltaC
  63499        \type real
  63500        \default autosize
  63501        \autosizable
  63502   N2 , \field Maximum Actuated Flow
  63503        \type real
  63504        \minimum 0
  63505        \autosizable
  63506        \default autosize
  63507        \units m3/s
  63508        \ip-units gal/min
  63509   N3 ; \field Minimum Actuated Flow
  63510        \type real
  63511        \minimum 0
  63512        \default 0.0
  63513        \units m3/s
  63514        \ip-units gal/min
  63515 
  63516 Controller:OutdoorAir,
  63517        \memo Controller to set the outdoor air flow rate for an air loop. Control options include
  63518        \memo fixed, proportional, scheduled, economizer, and demand-controlled ventilation.
  63519   \min-fields 16
  63520   A1 , \field Name
  63521        \type alpha
  63522        \required-field
  63523        \reference AirLoopControllers
  63524        \reference OAControllerNames
  63525   A2 , \field Relief Air Outlet Node Name
  63526        \type node
  63527        \required-field
  63528   A3 , \field Return Air Node Name
  63529        \type node
  63530        \required-field
  63531   A4 , \field Mixed Air Node Name
  63532        \type node
  63533        \required-field
  63534   A5 , \field Actuator Node Name
  63535        \type node
  63536        \required-field
  63537        \note Outdoor air inlet node entering the first pre-treat component if any
  63538   N1 , \field Minimum Outdoor Air Flow Rate
  63539        \note If there is a Mechanical Ventilation Controller (Controller:MechanicalVentilation), note
  63540        \note that this value times the Minimum Outdoor Air Schedule is a hard minimum that may
  63541        \note override DCV or other advanced OA controls.
  63542        \type real
  63543        \required-field
  63544        \units m3/s
  63545        \autosizable
  63546   N2 , \field Maximum Outdoor Air Flow Rate
  63547        \type real
  63548        \required-field
  63549        \units m3/s
  63550        \autosizable
  63551   A6 , \field Economizer Control Type
  63552        \type choice
  63553        \key FixedDryBulb
  63554        \key FixedEnthalpy
  63555        \key DifferentialDryBulb
  63556        \key DifferentialEnthalpy
  63557        \key FixedDewPointAndDryBulb
  63558        \key ElectronicEnthalpy
  63559        \key DifferentialDryBulbAndEnthalpy
  63560        \key NoEconomizer
  63561        \default NoEconomizer
  63562   A7 , \field Economizer Control Action Type
  63563        \type choice
  63564        \key ModulateFlow
  63565        \key MinimumFlowWithBypass
  63566        \default ModulateFlow
  63567   N3 , \field Economizer Maximum Limit Dry-Bulb Temperature
  63568        \type real
  63569        \units C
  63570        \note Enter the maximum outdoor dry-bulb temperature limit for FixedDryBulb
  63571        \note economizer control type. No input or blank input means this limit is
  63572        \note not operative. Limit is applied regardless of economizer control type.
  63573   N4 , \field Economizer Maximum Limit Enthalpy
  63574        \type real
  63575        \units J/kg
  63576        \note Enter the maximum outdoor enthalpy limit for FixedEnthalpy economizer control type.
  63577        \note No input or blank input means this limit is not operative
  63578        \note Limit is applied regardless of economizer control type.
  63579   N5 , \field Economizer Maximum Limit Dewpoint Temperature
  63580        \type real
  63581        \units C
  63582        \note Enter the maximum outdoor dewpoint temperature limit for FixedDewPointAndDryBulb
  63583        \note economizer control type. No input or blank input means this limit is not operative.
  63584        \note Limit is applied regardless of economizer control type.
  63585   A8 , \field Electronic Enthalpy Limit Curve Name
  63586        \type object-list
  63587        \object-list UnivariateFunctions
  63588        \note Enter the name of a quadratic or cubic curve which defines the maximum outdoor
  63589        \note humidity ratio (function of outdoor dry-bulb temperature) for ElectronicEnthalpy
  63590        \note economizer control type. No input or blank input means this limit is not operative
  63591        \note Limit is applied regardless of economizer control type.
  63592   N6 , \field Economizer Minimum Limit Dry-Bulb Temperature
  63593        \type real
  63594        \units C
  63595        \note Enter the minimum outdoor dry-bulb temperature limit for economizer control.
  63596        \note No input or blank input means this limit is not operative
  63597        \note Limit is applied regardless of economizer control type.
  63598   A9 , \field Lockout Type
  63599        \type choice
  63600        \key NoLockout
  63601        \key LockoutWithHeating
  63602        \key LockoutWithCompressor
  63603        \default NoLockout
  63604   A10, \field Minimum Limit Type
  63605        \type choice
  63606        \key FixedMinimum
  63607        \key ProportionalMinimum
  63608        \default ProportionalMinimum
  63609   A11, \field Minimum Outdoor Air Schedule Name
  63610        \type object-list
  63611        \object-list ScheduleNames
  63612        \note Schedule values multiply the minimum outdoor air flow rate
  63613   A12, \field Minimum Fraction of Outdoor Air Schedule Name
  63614        \type object-list
  63615        \object-list ScheduleNames
  63616        \note schedule values multiply the design/mixed air flow rate
  63617   A13, \field Maximum Fraction of Outdoor Air Schedule Name
  63618        \type object-list
  63619        \object-list ScheduleNames
  63620        \note schedule values multiply the design/mixed air flow rate
  63621   A14, \field Mechanical Ventilation Controller Name
  63622        \note Enter the name of a Controller:MechanicalVentilation object.
  63623        \type object-list
  63624        \object-list ControllerMechanicalVentNames
  63625        \note Optional field for defining outdoor ventilation air based on flow rate per unit floor
  63626        \note area and flow rate per person. Simplified method of demand-controlled ventilation.
  63627   A15, \field Time of Day Economizer Control Schedule Name
  63628        \type object-list
  63629        \object-list ScheduleNames
  63630        \note Optional schedule to simulate "push-button" type economizer control.
  63631        \note Schedule values greater than 0 indicate time-of-day economizer control is enabled.
  63632        \note Economizer control may be used with or without the high humidity control option.
  63633        \note When used together, high humidity control has priority over economizer control.
  63634        \note If the field Economizer Control Type = NoEconomizer, then this option is disabled.
  63635   A16, \field High Humidity Control
  63636        \type choice
  63637        \key Yes
  63638        \key No
  63639        \default No
  63640        \note Optional field to enable modified outdoor air flow rates based on zone relative humidity.
  63641        \note Select Yes to modify outdoor air flow rate based on a zone humidistat.
  63642        \note Select No to disable this feature.
  63643        \note If the field Economizer Control Type = NoEconomizer, then this option is disabled.
  63644   A17, \field Humidistat Control Zone Name
  63645        \type object-list
  63646        \object-list ZoneNames
  63647        \note Enter the name of the zone where the humidistat is located.
  63648        \note This field is only used when the field High Humidity Control = Yes.
  63649   N7 , \field High Humidity Outdoor Air Flow Ratio
  63650        \type real
  63651        \minimum> 0.0
  63652        \default 1.0
  63653        \note Enter the ratio of outdoor air to the maximum outdoor air flow rate when modified air
  63654        \note flow rates are active based on high indoor humidity.
  63655        \note The minimum value must be greater than 0.
  63656        \note This field is only used when the field High Humidity Control = Yes.
  63657   A18, \field Control High Indoor Humidity Based on Outdoor Humidity Ratio
  63658        \type choice
  63659        \key Yes
  63660        \key No
  63661        \default Yes
  63662        \note If No is selected, the outdoor air flow rate is modified any time indoor relative
  63663        \note humidity is above the humidistat setpoint. If Yes is selected, the outdoor air
  63664        \note flow rate is modified any time the indoor relative humidity is above the humidistat
  63665        \note setpoint and the outdoor humidity ratio is less than the indoor humidity ratio.
  63666        \note This field is only used when the field High Humidity Control = Yes.
  63667   A19; \field Heat Recovery Bypass Control Type
  63668        \type choice
  63669        \key BypassWhenWithinEconomizerLimits
  63670        \key BypassWhenOAFlowGreaterThanMinimum
  63671        \default BypassWhenWithinEconomizerLimits
  63672        \note BypassWhenWithinEconomizerLimits specifies that heat recovery
  63673        \note is active only when the economizer is off because conditions
  63674        \note are outside the economizer control limits
  63675        \note BypassWhenOAFlowGreaterThanMinimum specifies enhanced economizer
  63676        \note controls to allow heat recovery when economizer is active
  63677        \note (within limits) but the outdoor air flow rate is at the minimum.
  63678 
  63679 Controller:MechanicalVentilation,
  63680         \memo This object is used in conjunction with Controller:OutdoorAir to specify outdoor
  63681         \memo ventilation air based on outdoor air specified in the DesignSpecification:OutdoorAir object
  63682         \memo The Controller:OutdoorAir object is associated with a specific air loop, so the
  63683         \memo outdoor air flow rates specified in Controller:MechanicalVentilation correspond to the zones
  63684         \memo attached to that specific air loop.
  63685         \min-fields 8
  63686         \extensible:3 - repeat last three fields, remembering to remove ; from "inner" fields.
  63687         \memo Duplicate groups of Zone name, Design Specification Outdoor Air Object Name,
  63688         \memo and Design Specification Zone Air Distribution Object Name to increase allowable number of entries
  63689    A1,  \field Name
  63690         \required-field
  63691         \type alpha
  63692         \reference ControllerMechanicalVentNames
  63693    A2,  \field Availability Schedule Name
  63694         \note If this field is blank, the controller uses the values from the associated Controller:OutdoorAir.
  63695         \type object-list
  63696         \object-list ScheduleNames
  63697         \note Schedule values greater than 0 indicate mechanical ventilation is enabled
  63698    A3,  \field Demand Controlled Ventilation
  63699         \type choice
  63700         \key Yes
  63701         \key No
  63702         \default No
  63703    A4,  \field System Outdoor Air Method
  63704         \type choice
  63705         \key ZoneSum
  63706         \key VentilationRateProcedure
  63707         \key IndoorAirQualityProcedure
  63708         \key ProportionalControlBasedOnDesignOccupancy
  63709         \key ProportionalControlBasedonOccupancySchedule
  63710         \key IndoorAirQualityProcedureGenericContaminant
  63711         \key IndoorAirQualityProcedureCombined
  63712         \key ProportionalControlBasedOnDesignOARate
  63713         \default VentilationRateProcedure
  63714    N1,  \field Zone Maximum Outdoor Air Fraction
  63715         \type real
  63716         \default 1.0
  63717         \minimum> 0.0
  63718         \units dimensionless
