  64418 AirLoopHVAC:OutdoorAirSystem,
  64419        \memo Outdoor air subsystem for an AirLoopHVAC. Includes an outdoor air mixing box and
  64420        \memo optional outdoor air conditioning equipment such as heat recovery, preheat, and precool
  64421        \memo coils. From the perspective of the primary air loop the outdoor air system is treated
  64422        \memo as a single component.
  64423        \min-fields 3
  64424    A1, \field Name
  64425        \required-field
  64426        \type alpha
  64427        \reference-class-name validBranchEquipmentTypes
  64428        \reference validBranchEquipmentNames
  64429    A2, \field Controller List Name
  64430        \note Enter the name of an AirLoopHVAC:ControllerList object or blank if this object is used in
  64431        \note AirLoopHVAC:DedicatedOutdoorAirSystem.
  64432        \type object-list
  64433        \object-list ControllerLists
  64434    A3, \field Outdoor Air Equipment List Name
  64435        \note Enter the name of an AirLoopHVAC:OutdoorAirSystem:EquipmentList object.
  64436        \required-field
  64437        \type object-list
  64438        \object-list AirLoopOAEquipmentLists
  64439    A4; \field Availability Manager List Name
  64440        \note Enter the name of an AvailabilityManagerAssignmentList object.
  64441        \type object-list
  64442        \object-list SystemAvailabilityManagerLists
  64443 
  64444 OutdoorAir:Mixer,
