  66231         \note This field is only relevant for branches in PlantLoops and CondenserLoops
  66232         \note Air loops do not account for pressure drop using this field
  66233         \note Valid curve types are: Curve:Functional:PressureDrop or
  66234         \note one of Curve:{Linear,Quadratic,Cubic,Exponent}')
