  67685 OutdoorAir:Node,
  67686        \memo This object sets the temperature and humidity conditions
  67687        \memo for an outdoor air node.  It allows the height above ground to be
  67688        \memo specified.  This object may be used more than once.
  67689        \memo The same node name may not appear in both an OutdoorAir:Node object and
  67690        \memo an OutdoorAir:NodeList object.
  67691        \memo This object defines local outdoor air environmental conditions.
  67692   A1,  \field Name
  67693        \required-field
  67694        \reference OutdoorAirNodeNames
  67695        \type node
  67696   N1,  \field Height Above Ground
  67697        \note A value less than zero indicates that the height will be ignored and the weather file conditions will be used.
  67698        \type real
  67699        \units m
  67700        \default -1.0
  67701   A2 , \field Drybulb Temperature Schedule Name
  67702        \type object-list
  67703        \object-list ScheduleNames
  67704        \note Schedule values are real numbers, -100.0 to 100.0, units C
  67705   A3 , \field Wetbulb Temperature Schedule Name
  67706        \type object-list
  67707        \object-list ScheduleNames
  67708        \note Schedule values are real numbers, -100.0 to 100.0, units C
  67709   A4 , \field Wind Speed Schedule Name
  67710        \type object-list
  67711        \object-list ScheduleNames
  67712        \note Schedule values are real numbers, 0.0 to 40.0, units m/s
  67713   A5 , \field Wind Direction Schedule Name
  67714        \type object-list
  67715        \object-list ScheduleNames
  67716        \note Schedule values are real numbers, 0.0 to 360.0, units degree
  67717   A6 , \field Wind Pressure Coefficient Curve Name
  67718        \type object-list
  67719        \object-list WPCValueNames
  67720        \object-list UnivariateFunctions
  67721        \note The name of the AirflowNetwork:MultiZone:WindPressureCoefficientValues, curve, or table object specifying the wind pressure coefficient.
  67722   A7 , \field Symmetric Wind Pressure Coefficient Curve
  67723        \type choice
  67724        \key Yes
  67725        \key No
  67726        \default No
  67727        \note Specify whether the pressure curve is symmetric or not.
  67728        \note Specify Yes for curves that should be evaluated from 0 to 180 degrees
  67729        \note Specify No for curves that should be evaluated from 0 to 360 degrees
  67730   A8 ; \field Wind Angle Type
  67731        \type choice
  67732        \key Absolute
  67733        \key Relative
  67734        \default Absolute
  67735        \note Specify whether the angle used to compute the wind pressure coefficient is absolute or relative
  67736        \note Specify Relative to compute the angle between the wind direction and the surface azimuth
  67737        \note Specify Absolute to use the wind direction angle directly
  67738 
  67739 OutdoorAir:NodeList,
  67740        \extensible:1 Just duplicate last field and comments (changing numbering, please)
  67741        \memo This object sets the temperature and humidity conditions
  67742        \memo for an outdoor air node using the weather data values.
  67743        \memo to vary outdoor air node conditions with height above ground
  67744        \memo use OutdoorAir:Node instead of this object.
  67745        \memo This object may be used more than once.
  67746        \memo The same node name may not appear in both an OutdoorAir:Node object and
  67747        \memo an OutdoorAir:NodeList object.
  67748   A1 , \field Node or NodeList Name 1
  67749        \required-field
  67750        \type node
