  68247    A7,  \field This Domain Includes Basement Surface Interaction
  68248         \type choice
  68249         \key Yes
  68250         \key No
  68251         \default No
  68252         \note if Yes, then the following basement inputs are used
  68253         \note if No, then the following basement inputs are *ignored*
  68254    N15, \field Width of Basement Floor in Ground Domain
  68255         \type real
  68256         \units m
  68257         \note Required only if Domain Has Basement Interaction
  68258    N16, \field Depth of Basement Wall In Ground Domain
  68259         \type real
  68260         \units m
  68261         \note Required only if Domain Has Basement Interaction
  68262    A8,  \field Shift Pipe X Coordinates By Basement Width
  68263         \type choice
  68264         \key Yes
  68265         \key No
  68266         \note Required only if Domain Has Basement Interaction
  68267    A9,  \field Name of Basement Wall Boundary Condition Model
  68268         \type object-list
  68269         \object-list OSCMNames
  68270         \note Required only if Domain Has Basement Interaction
  68271    A10,  \field Name of Basement Floor Boundary Condition Model
  68272         \type object-list
  68273         \object-list OSCMNames
  68274         \note Required only if Domain Has Basement Interaction
  68275    N17, \field Convergence Criterion for the Outer Cartesian Domain Iteration Loop
  68276         \type real
  68277         \units deltaC
  68278         \minimum 0.000001
  68279         \maximum 0.5
  68280         \default 0.001
  68281    N18, \field Maximum Iterations in the Outer Cartesian Domain Iteration Loop
  68282         \type integer
  68283         \minimum 3
  68284         \maximum 10000
  68285         \default 500
  68286    N19, \field Evapotranspiration Ground Cover Parameter
  68287         \type real
  68288         \minimum 0
  68289         \maximum 1.5
  68290         \default 0.4
  68291         \note This specifies the ground cover effects during evapotranspiration
  68292         \note  calculations.  The value roughly represents the following cases:
  68293         \note  = 0   : concrete or other solid, non-permeable ground surface material
  68294         \note  = 0.5 : short grass, much like a manicured lawn
  68295         \note  = 1   : standard reference state (12 cm grass)
  68296         \note  = 1.5 : wild growth
  68297    N20, \field Number of Pipe Circuits Entered for this Domain
  68298         \required-field
