  68918        \maximum 1.0
  68919   A8,  \field Design Power Sizing Method
  68920        \note Used to indicate which sizing factor is used to calculate Design Power Consumption.
  68921        \type choice
  68922        \key PowerPerFlow
  68923        \note PowerPerFlow indicates that Design Electric Power per Unit Flow Rate is used as scaling factor.
