  69134        \memo module. These parameters are based on the testing methodologies described in ASHRAE
  69135        \memo Standards 93 and 96 which are used Solar Rating and Certification Corporation (SRCC)
  69136        \memo Directory of SRCC Certified Solar Collector Ratings. See EnergyPlus DataSets file
  69137        \memo SolarCollectors.idf.
