  69465 SolarCollector:UnglazedTranspired,
  69466        \memo Unglazed transpired solar collector (UTSC) used to condition outdoor air. This type of
  69467        \memo collector is generally used to heat air drawn through perforated absorbers and also
  69468        \memo recover heat conducted out through the underlying surface. This object represents a
  69469        \memo single collector attached to one or more building or shading surfaces and to one or
  69470        \memo more outdoor air systems.
  69471        \min-fields 23
  69472        \extensible:1 - repeat last field, remembering to remove ; from "inner" fields.
  69473   A1 , \field Name
