  70214        \note Fraction of compressor electrical energy that must be rejected by the condenser.
  70215        \note Enter a value of 1.0 when modeling hermetic chillers.
  70216        \note For open chillers, enter the compressor motor efficiency.
  70217        \note This value should be greater than 0.6 for practical applications.
  70218        \minimum> 0.0
  70219        \maximum 1.0
  70220        \default 1.0
  70221   N12, \field Leaving Chilled Water Lower Temperature Limit
  70222        \type real
  70223        \default 2.0
  70224        \units C
  70225   A10, \field Chiller Flow Mode Type
  70226        \note Select operating mode for fluid flow through the chiller. "NotModulated" is for
  70227        \note either variable or constant pumping with flow controlled by the external plant system.
  70228        \note "ConstantFlow" is for constant pumping with flow controlled by chiller to operate at
  70229        \note full design flow rate.  "LeavingSetpointModulated" is for variable pumping with flow
  70230        \note controlled by chiller to vary flow to target a leaving temperature setpoint.
  70231        \type choice
  70232        \key ConstantFlow
  70233        \key LeavingSetpointModulated
  70234        \key NotModulated
  70235        \default NotModulated
  70236   N13, \field Design Heat Recovery Water Flow Rate
  70237        \type real
  70238        \note If non-zero, then the heat recovery inlet and outlet node names must be entered.
  70239        \units m3/s
  70240        \minimum 0.0
  70241        \default 0.0
  70242        \ip-units gal/min
  70243        \autosizable
  70244   A11, \field Heat Recovery Inlet Node Name
  70245        \type node
  70246   A12, \field Heat Recovery Outlet Node Name
  70247        \type node
