  70421 Chiller:Absorption:Indirect,
  70422    \min-fields 17
  70423        \memo This indirect absorption chiller model is an enhanced model from the
  70424        \memo Building Loads and System Thermodynamics (BLAST) program.  Chiller
  70425        \memo performance curves are generated by fitting catalog data to third order
  70426        \memo polynomial equations. The chiller capacity is a function of condenser,
  70427        \memo chilled water, and generator temperatures. The heat input is a function
  70428        \memo of part-load ratio, condenser temperature, and chilled water temperature.
