  72164 PlantComponent:TemperatureSource,
  72165        \memo Simulates an object of pre-determined (constant or scheduled) source temperature
  72166        \memo The object introduces fluid into the plant loop at the specified temperature and
  72167        \memo  at the same flow rate as the fluid enters the component
  72168        \memo Fluid entering the component vanishes equivalent to the relief air in an air system
  72169   A1 , \field Name
  72170        \required-field
  72171        \type alpha
  72172        \note Component Name
  72173        \reference-class-name validPlantEquipmentTypes
  72174        \reference validPlantEquipmentNames
  72175        \reference-class-name validCondenserEquipmentTypes
