  72209 CentralHeatPumpSystem,
  72210        \min-fields 14
  72211        \memo This chiller bank can contain multiple chiller heaters and heat pump performance objects.
  72212        \memo Its function is to encapsulate the extra controls needed to turn individual modules on/off
  72213        \memo and whether they are to operate in cooling-only, heating-only or simultaneous cooling/heating
  72214        \memo mode and whether to connect the source water to the evaporator or condenser side.
