  74374        \key UserSpecifiedDesignCapacity
  74375        \note User can define fluid cooler thermal performance by specifying the fluid cooler UA
  74376        \note and the Design Water Flow Rate, or by specifying the fluid cooler Standard Design
  74377        \note Capacity or by specifying Design Capacity for Non standard conditions.
