  76615        \note The use side effectiveness in the stratified tank model is a simplified analogy of
  76616        \note a heat exchanger's effectiveness. This effectiveness is equal to the fraction of
  76617        \note use mass flow rate that directly mixes with the tank fluid. And one minus the
  76618        \note effectiveness is the fraction that bypasses the tank. The use side mass flow rate
  76619        \note that bypasses the tank is mixed with the fluid or water leaving the stratified tank.
