  76758 WaterHeater:Sizing,
  76759        \min-fields 4
  76760        \memo This input object is used with WaterHeater:Mixed or
  76761        \memo with WaterHeater:Stratified to autosize tank volume and heater capacity
  76762        \memo This object is not needed if water heaters are not autosized.
  76763   A1 , \field WaterHeater Name
  76764        \required-field
  76765        \type object-list
  76766        \object-list WaterHeaterNames
  76767   A2 , \field Design Mode
