  77574 ThermalStorage:ChilledWater:Stratified,
  77575        \memo Chilled water storage with a stratified, multi-node tank. The chilled water is
  77576        \memo "used" by drawing from the "Use Side" of the water tank.  The tank is indirectly
  77577        \memo charged by circulating cold water through the "Source Side" of the water tank.
