  78008 \group Plant-Condenser Control
  78009 
  78010 PlantEquipmentList,
  78011     \memo List plant equipment in order of operating priority, 1st in list will be used 1st, etc
  78012     \memo Use only plant equipment in this list.
  78013     \memo If no equipment object types and equipment names are specified, then the corresponding
  78014     \memo PlantEquipmentOperation:* object will assume all available plant equipment for the loop
  78015     \memo should be OFF (not operate) within the specified lower/upper limit.
  78016     \min-fields 1
  78017     \extensible:2
  78018   A1 , \field Name
  78019         \required-field
