  79170 PlantEquipmentOperation:ThermalEnergyStorage,
  79171        \memo Plant equipment operation scheme for simpler input to control thermal (ice)
  79172        \memo energy storage systems.  It replaces a host of setpoint managers with simple,
  79173        \memo single input values.  For more complex controls, use the ComponentSetpoint
  79174        \memo scheme.
  79175        \min-fields 7
  79176    A1, \field Name
  79177        \required-field
  79178        \reference ControlSchemeList
  79179    A2, \field On-Peak Schedule
  79180        \required-field
  79181        \type object-list
  79182        \object-list ScheduleNames
  79183    A3, \field Charging Availability Schedule
  79184        \required-field
  79185        \type object-list
  79186        \object-list ScheduleNames
  79187    N1, \field Non-Charging Chilled Water Temperature
  79188        \note Single temperature for chiller outlet when not in cooling season
  79189        \note or during on-peak cooling (discharge)
  79190        \required-field
  79191        \type real
  79192        \units C
  79193    N2, \field Charging Chilled Water Temperature
  79194        \note Single temperature for chiller outlet when off-peak during cooling
  79195        \note season (charging)
  79196        \required-field
  79197        \type real
  79198        \units C
  79199    A4, \field Component 1 Object Type
  79200        \note This field is the type of object and should either be a chiller or some
  79201        \note ice storage equipment.
  79202        \required-field
  79203        \type choice
  79204        \key ThermalStorage:Ice:Simple
  79205        \key ThermalStorage:Ice:Detailed
  79206        \key Chiller:Electric:EIR
  79207        \key Chiller:Electric:ReformulatedEIR
  79208        \key Chiller:Electric
  79209        \key Chiller:Absorption:Indirect
  79210        \key Chiller:Absorption
  79211        \key Chiller:ConstantCOP
  79212        \key Chiller:EngineDriven
  79213        \key Chiller:CombustionTurbine
  79214    A5, \field Component 1 Name
  79215        \note This field is the name of either the chiller or ice storage equipment
  79216        \note on the loop.
  79217        \required-field
  79218        \type object-list
  79219        \object-list IceThermalStorageEquipment
  79220        \object-list Chillers
  79221    A6, \field Component 1 Demand Calculation Node Name
  79222        \note This field is the name of the inlet node for the component defined in
  79223        \note the two previous input fields.
  79224        \required-field
  79225        \type node
  79226    A7, \field Component 1 Setpoint Node Name
  79227        \note This field is the name of the outlet node for the component listed above.
  79228        \required-field
  79229        \type node
  79230    N3, \field Component 1 Flow Rate
  79231        \note This field is the flow rate for the component listed above.
  79232        \required-field
  79233        \type real
  79234        \units m3/s
  79235        \autosizable
  79236    A8, \field Component 1 Operation Type
  79237        \note This field is the operation type for the component listed above.  For this
  79238        \note plant equipment operation scheme, "Cooling" should be selected for chiller
  79239        \note equipment while ice storage equipment should be defined as "Dual".
  79240        \required-field
  79241        \type choice
  79242        \key Heating
  79243        \key Cooling
  79244        \key Dual
