  79507 PlantEquipmentOperation:OutdoorDryBulbDifference,
  79508        \memo Plant equipment operation scheme for outdoor dry-bulb temperature difference
  79509        \memo operation. Specifies one or more groups of equipment which are available to operate
  79510        \memo for successive ranges based the difference between a reference node temperature and
  79511        \memo the outdoor dry-bulb temperature.
