  79945 PlantEquipmentOperationSchemes,
  79946        \memo Operation schemes are listed in "priority" order.  Note that each scheme
  79947        \memo must address the entire load and/or condition ranges for the simulation.
  79948        \memo The actual one selected for use will be the first that is "Scheduled"
  79949        \memo on.  That is, if control scheme 1 is not "on" and control scheme 2
  79950        \memo is -- then control scheme 2 is selected.
  79951        \memo Only plant equipment should be listed on a Control Scheme for this item.
