  82191 SetpointManager:SingleZone:Humidity:Minimum,
  82192      \memo The Single Zone Minimum Humidity Setpoint Manager allows the
  82193      \memo control of a single zone minimum humidity level.
  82194      \memo This setpoint manager can be used in conjunction with
  82195      \memo object ZoneControl:Humidistat to detect humidity levels.
  82196   A1 , \field Name
  82197        \required-field
  82198   A2 , \field Setpoint Node or NodeList Name
  82199        \required-field
  82200        \type node
  82201        \note Node(s) at which humidity ratio setpoint will be set
  82202   A3 ; \field Control Zone Air Node Name
  82203        \required-field
  82204        \type node
  82205        \note Name of the zone air node for the humidity control zone
  82206 
  82207 SetpointManager:SingleZone:Humidity:Maximum,
  82208      \memo The Single Zone Maximum Humidity Setpoint Manager allows the
  82209      \memo control of a single zone maximum humidity level.
  82210      \memo This setpoint manager can be used in conjunction with
  82211      \memo object ZoneControl:Humidistat to detect humidity levels.
  82212   A1 , \field Name
  82213        \required-field
  82214   A2 , \field Setpoint Node or NodeList Name
  82215        \required-field
  82216        \type node
  82217        \note Node(s) at which humidity ratio setpoint will be set
  82218   A3 ; \field Control Zone Air Node Name
  82219        \required-field
  82220        \type node
  82221        \note Name of the zone air node for the humidity control zone
  82222 
  82223 SetpointManager:MixedAir,
  82224      \memo The Mixed Air Setpoint Manager is meant to be used in conjunction
  82225      \memo with a Controller:OutdoorAir object. This setpoint manager is used
  82226      \memo to establish a temperature setpoint at the mixed air node.
