  82259 SetpointManager:OutdoorAirPretreat,
  82260        \min-fields 11
  82261        \memo This setpoint manager determines the required
  82262        \memo conditions at the outdoor air stream node which will
  82263        \memo produce the reference setpoint condition at the
  82264        \memo mixed air node when mixed with the return air stream
  82265   A1 , \field Name
  82266        \required-field
  82267   A2 , \field Control Variable
  82268        \type choice
  82269        \key Temperature
  82270        \key HumidityRatio
  82271        \key MaximumHumidityRatio
  82272        \key MinimumHumidityRatio
